<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1 Kumpite</book>
  <para style="h">1 Kumpite</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Kumpite</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kumpite</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kumpite</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi David vuoi-in a kum a tam ta hi; tuale amate in puon tampi silsah nan ule a ama a khuo lum thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nasemte in ama kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa dingin nungah siengtho khat kisui hinlen, ama in kumpipa enin a kemnu hi taheh; ka pu kumpipa a khuo lum thei nadingin a kang sungah lum heh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in zong Israel gam sung zosie-ah nungah melhoi khat sui-in Shunem-te Abishag a mu vua, kumpipa kungah a zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua nungahno a mel hoi mama hi. Ama nu pen kumpipa kemnu suohin ama’ na sem a, hizongle kumpipa in ama a luppi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in Haggith’ tapa Adonijah ama le ama kitawi sangin, “Kei kumpi ka hi ding hi,” a ci hi; ama in ama adingin sakol leengte le sakol tung tuongte, le a mai-a tai ding mi sawmnga kithawisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pa David in, “Bang dinga hici gamtat na hei?” ci-in khatvei beh zong dongin a phawhsie ngai sih hi. Ama pasal melhoi mama khat ahi a, Absalom zoma suoh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Zeruiah’ tapa Joab le siempu Abiathar tawh vai a hawm a, amate in Adonijah a panpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin siempu Zadok, Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah, le kamsang Nathan, Shimei, Rei, le David’ aituom galhangte in Adonijah a panpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Enrogel gei-a om Zoheleth suongpi pangah Adonijah in tuute, bawngtangte, le ganta thaute tawh biehpiehna nei a, ama in a sanggam zosie, kumpipa’ tapate, le Judah gam sunga kumpi uliente zosie hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hinanle ama in kamsang Nathan hile, Benaiah hile, galhangte hile, a sanggampa Solomon hile hlan lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Nathan in Solomon’ nu Bathsheba kungah, “Haggith’ tapa Adonijah kumpi suoh dawh melin, i pu David in lah tua thu a theikhah lo lam a za nai lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nangma’ hinna le na tapa Solomon’ hinna na hutdam thei nadingin tu-in hing pei inlen thu khat nang hil vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in kumpi David kungah pei-in ama tungah, ‘Ka pu kumpipa in nasemnu tungah, “Keima’ zaluo kumpi ding khu na tapa Solomon ahi a, tuaci’n ama ka kumpi topha tungah a to ding hi,” ci-in hing kiciem hi lo na mah? Tua ahile bang dinga Adonijah kumpi suoh thei ahei?’ va ci ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum sunga kumpipa tawh na holim laitahin keima hing sungtumin na thugen teng kang kipsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa innkhan sungah Bathsheba a tum hi; Kumpipa vuoi mama ta hi; Shunem-te Abishag in kumpipa kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bathsheba in kumpipa tungah zatahna pie-in kun a, tuale kumpipa in, “Bang dei na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua nu in zong ama kungah, “Ka pu aw, na nasemnu tungah Topa na Pasien’ min tawh tam bangin nang kiciem ngai hi: Na tapa Solomon in ka kumpi za luo-in ka kumpi topha tungah a to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in ka pupa kumpipa in na thei lo vangin, Adonijah thakhatin kumpi suoh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in biehpiehna-in bawngtangte, ganta thaute, le tuute, tampi pie zo a, kumpipa’ tapate zosie, siempu Abiathar, le galkapmangpa Joab zong a hlan hi; ahi vangin ama in na nasempa Solomon hlan lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka pu kumpipa aw, na nua ciengin ka pu kumpipa’ topha tungah koi to ding ci thu amate kungah na gen ding ngahin Israel zosie in nang mit tuhna-in ang nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua bang hing hi sih mawh leh na pate tawh ka pu kumpipa na lupton ciengin kei le ka tapa Solomon khu mawneite banga ei kingaisun pai lien ding ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa tawh tua nu a holim laitahin kamsang Nathan a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah, “Tam munah kamsang Nathan om hi,” ci-in kigen hi. Kumpipa mai-ah a pei ciengin ama in kumpipa zatahna pie-in a mai tuolah a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nathan in, “Ka pu kumpipa aw, ‘Adonijah in keima’ za luo-in kumpi sem ding a, ka kumpi topha tungah a to ding hi,’ ci-in na gen zo ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tuni-in a peisuh zo ta a, ama in biehpiehna dingin bawngtangte, ganta thaute, le tuute, tampitah go a, kumpipa’ tate zosie, galkapmang Joab, le siempu Abiathar hlanin tu-in ama adingin pawi a bawl vua, ‘Kumpi Adonijah dam sawt heh!’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in na nasempa keima le siempu Zadok, Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah le na nasempa Solomon-te ei hlan lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka pu kumpipa in tam thu nangma’ sep ahi a, na nua cienga na kumpi topha tunga koi to ding ahei ci thu na nasemte ei theisah lo na ta amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpi David in dawng a, “Keima kungah Bathsheba hing hlan un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa opna-ah ama pei-in kumpipa mai-ah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa kiciem a, “Hahsatna zosie pan ka hinna ei hundam Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />nangma tungah Topa Israel Pasien’ min tawh kiciemin, ‘Na tapa Solomon in ka kumpi za luo ding a, keima tangin kumpi topha tungah a to ding hi,’ ka cisa ma bangin tuni-in zong ka cikia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mai tuol kunin Bathsheba in ama zatahna pie a, “Ka pu kumpi David hing tawntung heh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumpi David in, “Ka kungah siempu Zadok, kamsang Nathan, le Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah hing peisah un,” a ci hi. Kumpipa mai-ah a tun ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />kumpipa in amate kungah, “Na pu’ nasemte peipi-in ka sakol tungah ka tapa Solomon tuongsah unlen, Gihon ah hing peipisuh ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khum munah siempu Zadok le kamsang Nathan in Israel tungah kumpi dingin ama sathau nusah un; tua ciengin pengkul mut unlen, ‘Kumpi Solomon dam sawt heh!’ ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama’ nua zui-in na peito ding uhi. Ama sungtumin ka kumpi topha tungah tosah un; keima tangin ama kumpi a suoh ding hi; azieh pen keima in Israel le Judah tungah a uh dingin ama ka koi zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah in kumpipa dawng a, “Hi taheh! Topa , ka pu kumpipa’ Pasien in tua bangin kipsah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka pu kumpipa tawh Topa a opton bangin Solomon tawh zong omton hinlen, ka pu kumpi David’ topha sangin ama’ topha liensah zaw taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempu Zadok, kamsang Nathan, Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah, Chereth-te le Peleth-te peisuhin David’ laa-sakol tungah Solomon tuongsahin Gihon-ah a zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khum mun puonbuh sung panin siempu Zadok in sathau koina bung la-in ama in Solomon a nu hi. Tua ciengin amate in pengkul mutin mi zosie in, “Kumpi Solomon dam sawt heh!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi zosie in ama zui-in peito-in theile a tum vua, nahpitahin lungdamin a kipah vua, a gamlumna un lei a kilingsah valia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Adonijah le a ompi lengla zosie in pawibawl a man zaw ciengun tam thu a za uhi. Joab in pengkul kimut ging a zah bepin, “Bang dinga khuopi sung hici gin vapual adiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in thu a gen laitahin siempu Abiathar’ tapa Jonathan a tung hi. Adonijah in, “Hing lut in. Nang pen mi gina khat na hi ziehin thuhoi hing puoh valon vateh” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jonathan in Adonijah dawng in, “Hi lo hi, bangzieh ahei cile i pu Kumpi David in Solomon kumpi suohsah zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />kumpipa in ama tawh siempu Zadok, kamsang Nathan, Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah, Chereth-te, le Peleth-te sawlin a kumpipa’ laa-sakol tungah ama a tuongsah zo ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />siempu Zadok le kamsang Nathan in kumpi dingin ama Gihon ah sathau a nu zo ta uhi; tuale amate khum panin lungdam kipahin a kato zo ziehun khuopi sungah gamlumna a om hi. Na zah husa khu tami ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tu-in kumpi topha tungah Solomon a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua tham loin i pu kumpi David a lungdampi dingin kumpipa’ nasemte a pei vua, “Pasien in nangma’ min sangin Solomon’ min thangsahzaw hinlen, nangma’ topha sangin ama’ topha lienzawsah taheh,” a ci uhi. A lupna tungah biehna lui-in kumpipa kunsuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />‘Tuni-in keima muna-ah ka suonlehlahte khat ka kumpi topha tunga to dinga a pie Topa , Israel Pasien in thupha nga taheh,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ciengin Adonijah’ lengla zosie a citunsa-in a lampi ciet vuah a pei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Adonijah in Solomon a giin ziehin dingin maitam kite a tupom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Solomon kungah, “Adonijah in Kumpi Solomon a giing hi; en in, ama in maitam kite tupom a, ‘Kumpi Solomon in namsau tawh na nasemte a tha lo nadingin ka kungah Kumpi Solomon hing kiciem masa heh,’ ci hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuaci’n Solomon in, “Ama in a migitna a lah thei leh a samzam khat zong tuolah kie lo ding hi; ahi vangin ama sungah gitlona a kimu leh ama si ding hi,” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Solomon in maitam panin ama a peipisuh nadingun mi a sawl hi. Kumpi Solomon zatahna pie dingin ama pei hi; tuale Solomon in ama kungah, “Na inn ah pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David a si ding hun a nai ciengin ama in tam bangin a tapa Solomon thu a vailhah hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kei ka hi leh leitung mi zosiete’ peina lampi-ah a pei ding ka hi ta hi. Thakhauh inlen hangsan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses’ thukham sunga kigiel bangin Topa na Pasien’ thuhilnate kemcingin a lampite tawn inlen, a thukhamte, a thupiehte, a biehna ngainate, le a teci pannate zui siem in. Tua bangin bawl po lacin na sepna zosie le na kiheina zosie-ah na dau ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima tawh kisai-in ama in: ‘Na tapate in a lungsim zosie ule a hinna zosie utawh keima mai-ah thuman tahin gamtat ding a lim ngaisut nah po uleh Israel kumpi topha tunga to ding mi na kitasam ngai sih ding uhi,’ ci-in a thugenna Topa in a kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tua tham loin Zeruiah’ tapa Joab in keima ei bawlna, gal sunga a si mite’ phula kinei-in gal ven hun sunga a mawh tha Israel galkapmang ni, Ner’ tapa Abner le Jether’ tapa Amasa tunga a bawlnate ziehin, a kawnga kigah a kawngga le a kephanga a kedap tungah gal sunga sisan luong teng a tusah hi, ci zong na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ziehin na pilna tawh kizui-in sem inlen, a samkang tawh hlamuongin Leinei gamah ama peisuhsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle Gilead mi Barzillai’ tapate tungah thuman tahin gamta inlen, na sabuoi-a annete tawh ankuong imtonsah in; azieh pen na sanggampa Absalom kung panin ka tai lai-in tua bang thumanna tawh kei ei na bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in Mahanaim ka zot ni-in a gimnei awsie tawh keima ei gausam, Bahurim pana ang pei Benjamin-te Gera’ tapa Shimei zong na kungah a om hi; ahi vangin kei ei dawn dingin Jordan ah ama ang pei lai-in ama tungah Topa’ min tawh ka kiciem a, ‘Namsau tawh nang kang that sih ding hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama maw nei lo bangin ngaisun tuon sin, azieh pen nang mi pil khat na hi hi; nang in ama na law dan ding na thei lel ding hi. A lu tunga a samkang khu sisan tawh Leinei gamah na peisuhsah hamtang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pu a pate tawh David lumton a, David khuopi sungah ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel tungah David kum sawmli sung maang hi; Hebron ah ama kum sagi sung maang a, Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum le kum thum sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pa David’ topha tungah Solomon a to hi; tuale ama’ kumpi gam kiptahin kiphut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon’ nu Bathsheba kungah Haggith’ tapa Adonijah a va haw ta hi. Tua nu in, “Thunuom tawh ang haw na hiei mah?” a na ci hi. Ama in, “Thunuom tawh ang haw hi ma ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin, “Nang kungah kamkhat kang gen thei diei mah?” a ci hi. Tua nu in, “Gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Tami kumpi gam kei-a’ ahi lamtah na thei hi. Israel zosie in kei a maang dingin ei lamen uhi; ahi vangin tam kumpi gam kihei-in ka sanggampa-a’ a suoh ta hi, bangzieh ahei cile tam thu pen Topa kung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale tu-in nang tungah nget ding khat ka nei hi; ei hlaw malmal sin,” a ci hi. Tua nu in ama kungah, “Gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “Hepina tawh ka zi dingin Kumpi Solomon kungah Shunem-te Abishag ei ngetpieh in. Ama in na thu ang niel sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bathsheba in, “Hoi mama hi; nangma tangin kumpipa kungah ka va gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Adonijah tangin ama tungah thu gen dingin Kumpi Solomon kungah Bathsheba a pei hi. Tua nu dawn dingin kumpipa ding a, tuale ama mai-ah a kun hi; tua ciengin a kumpi topha tungah ama to a, tuale kumpipa’ nu to nadingin kumpi topha khat lasahin ama’ zietlamah tua nu a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in, “Nang kungah thu neuno khat nget ding ka nei hi; ei hlaw sin,” a ci hi. Tuale kumpipa in tua nu kungah, “Na nget nop pen ngen in, ka nu aw; kang hlaw sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in, “Na sanggampa Adonijah zi dingin Shunem-te Abishag pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in a nu dawng a, “Bang zieha Adonijah zi dinga Abishag nang nget ahiei? Ama adingin kumpi gam zong ngetpieh vet ve! Azieh pen ama ka upa ahi hi; ama ding beh ngen sinlen siempu Abiathar le Zeruiah’ tapa Joab ading zong ngetpieh vet ve!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ minin Kumpi Solomon kiciem a, “Adonijah in tam thu gel zo ahi ziehin ama’ hinna in a sawn sih tah ma leh Pasien in keima ei dawm sih taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in kei ei sudetin ka pa David’ kumpi topha tungah ei koi a, ama’ ciemsa bangin keima tung le ka suon ka hlahte tungah kumpi gam ei pie Topa a hing ahi ma bangin tuni-in Adonijah kithat ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpi Solomon in Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah a sawl hi. Ama in tua pa satlia-in a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa in siempu Abiathar kungah, “Na gam ahi Anathoth ah kipei ta’n; azieh pen nang zong a si dinga kilawm na hi hi. Ahi vangin ka pa mai-ah Topa Pasien’ singkuong na puohpiehna le ka pa thuoh gentheina zosie na thuohpi ziehin tu tadi-in kang that sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Solomon in Topa’ siempu ahina panin Abiathar khawlsah a, Topa in Shiloh-ah Eli innkuon tawh kisai a gen thute tua bangin tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joab in Absalom a panpi sih vangin Adonijah a panpi na thu Joab tungah thu tha a tun ciengin Topa’ puonbuh sungah Joab tai pai a, maitam kite a tupom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon kungah, “ Topa’ puonbuh sungah Joab tai-in tu-in maitam pangah om hi,” ci-in a kigen ciengin Solomon in Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah sawl a, “Va pei-in ama va satlia ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ puonbuh sungah Benaiah pei-in ama kungah, “Kumpipa in thu ei pie a, ‘Hing pusuoh heh,’ ci hi,” a ci hi. Hizongle ama in, “Hi lo hi, tam sungah ka sizaw ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Benaiah in kumpipa tungah thu tutkia a, “Joab in tam bangin thu gen a, tam bangin ei dawng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa in dawngkia a, “Ama gensa bangin ama va satlia inlen hing vui ta’n; a thu om lopi-in Joab in sisan a luonsah mawna pen keima le ka pa’ innkuon tung panin tua bangin la dawh ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa in ama’ sisan luonsahna pen ama’ lu tung ma-ah a tusahkia ding hi. Azieh pen ka pa David’ thei lo kalin ama in ama sanga a thumanzaw le a hoizaw mi ni, Israel galkapmang Ner’ tapa Abner le Judah galkapmang Jether’ tapa Amasa a busim a, namsau tawh that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joab’ luzang le a suon a hlahte’ lu zangah a tawntungin ama gel’ sisan ang tungkia ding hi; ahi vangin David tung, a suon a hlahte tung, ama’ innkuon tung, le ama’ kumpi topha tungah Topa kung panin nopna om zing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah kuonto a, ama satin that hi; tuale gamlaha a inn ah ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kumpipa in Joab tangin galkapmang dingin Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah koi a, Abiathar tangin siempu Zadok koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in mi sawlin Shimei hlansahin ama kungah, “Nangma dingin Jerusalem ah inn khat lamin tuanah teng inlen, tua panin heima sung kal nawn sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na pei-a Kidron Lui na galkai ni ni-in a si valon ding na hi lam kithei pai in; nangma’ sisan nangma’ lu tungah a tu ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shimei in kumpipa kungah, “Thukhenna a dih hi; ka pu kumpipa gensa bangin na nasempa gamta ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Jerusalem ah ni tampi sung Shimei a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin kum thum zaw ciengin Gath Kumpipa Maacah’ tapa Achish kungah Shimei’ nasemte ni a tai uhi. Shimei kungah, “Gath ah na nasemte om hi,” ci-in a kigen ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Shimei ding pai a, laa phaw pha-in a silate sui dingin Gath-a Achish kungah a pei hi; Shimei pei-in Gath panin a silate a peipikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jerusalem panin Gath ah Shimei pei-in a kilekia lam Solomon kungah a kigen ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />kumpipa in mi sawlin Shimei hlansahin ama kungah, “ Topa tawh kang kiciemsah a, ‘Nang pusuohin mun khat popo-ah na pei ni ni-in a si ding na hi lam thei valon in,’ ci-in lipkhap tahin hing gen hi lo ka mah? Nangma in keima kungah, ‘Tua thukhenna dih hi; ka sang hi,’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua bang hi napi bang dingin Topa tungah na kiciemna palsatin kang thupiehte zui lo na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kumpipa in Shimei kungah, “Ka pa tunga sietna na bawl zosie na lungsim sungah a unpi-in na thei hi; tuaci’n Topa in na gamtat sietna teng nangma lu tungah ang tusahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahi vangin Kumpi Solomon in thupha nga ding a, Topa mai-ah David’ kumpi topha kisudet tawntung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah thu a pie hi; tuale ama pei-in Shimei sat hi, tuale ama a si hi. Tuaci’n Solomon’ khut sungah kumpi gam kikipsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kiten kipina vai ziehin Egypt kumpi Pharaoh tawh Solomon in kipawlna a bawl uhi; ama in Pharaoh’ tanu la a, ama’ inn, Topa’ inn le Jerusalem kimvelah kulpi lam a man masang, David khuopi sungah tua nu a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanle Topa’ min tawh biehinn kilam nai lo ahi ziehin mite in munsangte-ah biehpiehna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Topa it a, a pa David’ thukhamte a zui hi; ama beh in munsangte-ah biehpiehna pie-in gimnamtui a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biehpiehna pie dingin khum mun Gibeon ah kumpipa a pei hi, bangzieh ahei cile tua khu mun sang thupi pen ahi hi; Solomon in tua maitam tungah meihal biehna tulkhat a pie zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeon ah zanlai a mangin Solomon kungah Topa kihil hi; tuale Pasien in, “Kang pieh ding khat ngen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale Solomon in, “Nang in nasempa ka pa David tungah a lien le a kip itna na lah zo hi, bangzieh ahei cile nangma tungah muonhuoina, dihna, thumanna lungsim tawh ama a gamta hi; tuale nangma in ama adingin tami a lien itna kip na koipieh zo ta a, tuale tuni-in ama’ topha tunga a to ding tapa khat na pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile tu-in Topa ka Pasien aw, keima naupangno khat ka hi vangin ka pa David tangin na nasempa kumpi-in nei koi zo ta hi. Keima in sungtum dan ding le pusuo dan ding tahpi zong ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lien le a tam seng zieha a phaza a kisim zo lo, na teelsa mite lahah na nasempa a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na nasem pa in na mite ka uh thei nading le, a sie le a pha ka khentel thei nadingin thu theitelna lungsim ei pie in; azieh pen tam na mite koi in uh zo ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami Solomon’ ngetna in Topa a lungkimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in ama kungah, “Nang in na khansau nading hile, na hau nading hile, na galte zaw nading hile na ngen sih a, a sie le a pha khentel thei nadingin tami theitelna ngen na hi ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tu-in keima in na nget bangin nang kang pie ding hi. Keima in pilna le khentel theina lungsim nang kang pie tahtah hi; nang masangin nang tawh a kibang mi a om ngai sih a, na nua ciengin zong nang tawh kibang mi a om ngai ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang in na nget khah lo ahi na khan sung tungtawnin hauna le patawina zong kang pie ding hi; nangma tawh tekah thei ding kumpi dang koima a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pa David bangin ka lampite tawnin ka thukhamte le ka thupiehte na zui nah po leh na hinkhuo ka sawtsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon a khanglo hi; tua khu a mang ahi bo hi. Jerusalemah ama pei a, Topa’ thuciemna singkuong mai-ah dingin meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate pie a, a nasem zosie adingin pawi khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hun khat ciengin kumpipa kungah numei pahtat ni pei-in a mai-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A numei khat in, “Ka pu aw, tami numei tawh inn sung khatah ka tengton hi; tami inn sungah ama a op sungin keima in tapa khat ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka ta nei zaw a ni thum ni-in tami numei in zong ta ang nei hi. Ko gel ka omton uhi; inn sungah koima dang tawh ka omton sih gel hi, koma gel beh ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in zanlai-in a lupna-ah a tapa netpha kha ahi ziehin tami numei’ tapa a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zankim laitahin ama na tho a, na nasemnu ka kimut kalin ka kang sunga ka tapa ei na lahpiehin keima’ tapa pen a kang sungah na siel a, a sisa ama’ tapa pen ka kang sungah a na siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zingmawngin ka ta nawi pie dingin ka thaw ciengin ama a sisa-in ka mu hi; ahi vangin zingmawngin limtahin ka et ciengin tua pen keima sung pana a suoh tapa a na hi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin a numei dang khat in, “Hi lo hi, a hing tapa pen kei-a’ ahi a, a si tapa pen nang-a’ ahi bo hi,” ci-in a gen hi. Amasa nu in, “Hi lo hi, tapa a si pen nang-a’ ahi a, tapa a hing pen kei-a’ ahi bo hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa mai-ah ama gel a kisel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in, “Khat nu in lah, ‘A hing pen ka tapa ahi a, a si pen na tapa ahi hi,’ ci hi. Adang khat in zong, ‘Hi malmal sih! A si pen na tapa ahi hi; a hing pen ka tapa ahi hi,’ ci zel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in, “Namsau khat hing la un,” a ci le kumpipa mai-ah namsau khat a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Naupang a hing pen phal ni suo un; tua ciengin khat tungah alang pie unlen, adang khat tungah alang pie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin tapa a hing pen’ nu in a lungsimah a tapa a khuotuo ziehin kumpipa kungah, “Ka pupa aw, hepina tawh a hinglai naupang pen ama pie in; ama that malmal sin!” a ci hi. A khat pen in, “Ke’n lah tang sih vang, ama’n lah tang da taheh; phalsuo lel un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in a dawngkia hi: “Naupang a hinglai pen amasa numei pie un; ama that sih un. Tua nu pen ama’ nu ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi zosie in kumpipa thukhenna a za uhi; tuale amate in kumpipa lamdang a sa uhi, azieh pen ama in thu a tanga a khen thei nadingin ama’ sungah Pasien’ pilna a om lam amate in a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon in Israel zosie tungah kumpi sem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale tam teng pen ama’ vaihawm ulienpite ahi hi: Zadok’ tapa Azariah pen siempu ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shisha’ tapa Elihoreph le Ahijah-te pen thuvanpite ahi uhi; Ahilud’ tapa Jehoshaphat pen thuciemte ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah pen galkapmangpa ahi hi. Zadok le Abiathar-te pen siempute ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nathan’ tapa Azariah pen uliente tunga nasep uh ahi hi; Nathan’ tapa Zabud pen siempu le kumpipa’ lawm ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahishar pen kumpi inn uhpa ahi hi; Abda’ tapa Adoniram pen thona-aana nasemte uhpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi zosie tungah Solomon in ulien sawm le ni nei a, tua teng in kumpipa le a innkuonte adingin anneh tuidawn a sih uhi; mi khat in kum khatin anneh tuidawn hla khat ta a sih ciet ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau’ min pen: Ephraim muoltung gam sungah Ben-hur;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth-shemesh, le Elon-bethanan sungah Bendeker;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arubboth ah Ben-hesed; (Socoh le Hepher gam zosie ama-a’ ahi hi);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naphath-dor gam zosie-ah Ben-abinadab; (ama in Solomon’ tanu Taphath zi-in nei hi);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taanach, Megiddo, le Jezreel’ nei lam Zarethan panga om Beth-shean gam zosie, le Beth-shean panin Abel-meholah dong, Jokmeam galkhat pang langkhat dongah Ahilud’ tapa Baana;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rammoth-gilead sungah (ama in Gilead sunga om Manasseh’ tapa Jair’ khuoneute le Bashan sunga om Argob gam sung, kulpite le sumngo zawlte a nei khuopi lien sawmguh nei hi) ah Bengeber;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahanaim-ah Iddo’ tapa Ahinadab; Mahanaim khuo sungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali ah Ahimaaz: (ama in Solomon’ tanu Basemath zi-in la hi); Iddo’ tapa Ahinadab:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asher le Bealoth ah Hushai’ tapa Baana;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Issachar-ah Paruah’ tapa Jehoshaphat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin-ah Ela’ tapa Shimei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor-te’ kumpi Sihon le Bashan kumpi Og gam ahi Gilead gam sungah Uri’ tapa Geber ahi hi. Judah gam sungah ulien khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah le Israel pen tuipi gei senel za-in a tam uhi; amate in a du a dei teng uh ne-in dawnin a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon in Euphrates pan Philistia-te gam, Egypt gamgi nangawn dongah kumpi gam zosie a uh hi; amate in Solomon’ hin sung tungtawnin sieh le kaihte puohin a na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon’ nisiel anneh dingin annel cor sawm thum le annel cor sawmguh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />bawngtang thau sawm, le lodawng tawh a kivathau bawng sawmni, tuu zakhat, sakhitangte, sazuhte, sanangte, le a vasa thaute kisim nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in Euphrates nitumna lam gam zosie tawh Tiphsah panin Gaza cieng dong, Euphrates nitumna lampang kumpi zosie uh hi; ama’ kimvela zosie kilemin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon hin sungin Judah le Israel pen lungmuongin a om a, mi zosie in Dan panin Beer-sheba cieng dong nangawnin a lenggui le a theiphungte uh uopin lungmuongtahin a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in a sakol leengte dingin buh a nei ciet sakol tul sawmli le sakol tunga tuong mi tul sawm le tulni zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Uliente in amau’ sih hla-in kumpi Solomon le kumpi Solomon’ sabuoi tunga ankuong a impi mi zosie’ neh ding a pie ciet uhi; amate bangma a kitasam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amau’ nasep ciet tawh kizui-in a kisapna munah sakol leengte le sakol taihatte anva nadingin mangbuham le butu zong a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasien in Solomon tungah pilna tampi, thukhen siemna le tuipi gei senel za-a tam theina pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuaci’n Solomon’ pilna in nisuona lam mi zosie’ pilna le Egypt pilna zosie a khupsin sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Midangte sangin ama a pilzaw a, Ezrah-te Ethan, le Mahol’ tapa Heman, Calcol, le Darda te sangin zong a pilzaw lai hi; a kimvela minam zosie lahah a minthanna a kizel sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in paunah tul thum phuo a, a laphuo teng dawng tul le dawng nga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in Lebanon-a taamtah a patin kulh tunga po hyssop dongin singkung lopate’ thu a gen hi; ama in ganhingte, vate, a bawhvate, le ngate’ thu zong gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Solomon’ pilna thu ngai dingin minam zosie a pei uhi; ama’ pilna thu a zasa leitung kumpite zosie zong a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in amate in a pa’ munah ama kumpi dingin Solomon sathau nu zo ta uh, ci Tyre Kumpipa Hiram in a zah ciengin Solomon kungah a nasemte a sawl hi; bangzieh ahei cile Hiram le David a kilawmta den uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Hiram kungah kam vaihlah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa in ama’ ketaw nei-ah amahaw a koi masangin ama a kui-im a galte tawh kidona ziehin ka pa David in a Topa Pasien’ min dingin biehinn na lam zo lo hi, ci na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in Topa ka Pasien in ka kimkotah tawlngahna ei pie zo ta hi; ei langpang hile, hamsietna hile om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in ka pa David kungah, ‘Na kumpi topha tunga ka koi ding na tapa in nangma tangin ka min dingin biehinn a lam ding hi,’ ci-in a gensa bangin Topa ka Pasien’ min dingin biehinn khat lam ka sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima adingin Lebanon taamtah singte a kiphua thei nading thupie in. Keima’ nasemte le nangma’ nasemte in a semton ding vua, na nasemte dinga na se zaza thaman nang tungah kang pie ding hi; azieh pen ko kungah Sidon-te banga sing sui siem khat beh a op lo lam na thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon’ thugen teng Hiram in a zah ciengin ama a kipah mama a, tuale ama in, “Tuni-in tam minam lien a uh dingin David tunga tapa pil a pie Topa in thupha nga taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiram in Solomon kungah kam vaihlah a, “Ka tunga nang thupuoh ka za zo ta hi; taamtah sing le taapi sing tawh kisai na kisap zosie kang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lebanon panin ka nasemte in tuipi-ah tua teng ang puohsuh ding uhi; keima in tuipi tunga laam thei dingin tua teng phawngin kang bawl ding a, nangma’ genna munah kang tungsah ding hi. Khum munah nangma in na lah thei dingin tua singte amate ka phelsah ding hi. Ka innkuonte neh ding an ei sihin ka deina na kicingsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hiram in Solomon’ deigaw taamtah le taapi sing zosie a sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A innkuonte neh dingin Solomon in zong mangbu cor tul sawmni le sathau tuituoh cor sawmni dim ama a pie hi. Solomon in Hiram tungah kumsimin tam teng a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama tungah a ciemsa bangin Topa in Solomon pilna a pie hi. Hiram le Solomon kikalah kilemna a om hi; tuale ama gelin kithukimna khat a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon in Israel zosie panin thona-aana sem dingin mi a khon hi; a mi khonte tul sawmthum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in hla khatin amate tul sawm a kikhelin Lebanon lamah a sawl hi; Lebanon-ah hla khat sung omin inn ah hlani sung om ding uhi; Adoniram in thona-aana nasep uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon in nasem mi tul sawm sagi le muoltung gama suong kheng dingin zong mi tul sawmgiet nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama in nasepna van ding le nasem mite uh dingin kuligawng tul thum le zathum zong nei lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa’ thupiehna bangin suong kikheng zolsate tawh biehinn khuombul a phu thei nadingun suong golte le a manpha suongte a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Solomon’ innlamte, Hiram’ innlamte le Gebal-te in suongkheng nasep a sem vua, biehinn lam nadingin sing le suong a khol uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt gam panin Israel-te a peidawh lang kalsie kum zali le kum sawmgiet a cin kum, Israel-te’ tunga Solomon in a uh a kum lina, a hla nina Ziv hla sungin ama in Topa’ biehinn lam ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa dinga Kumpi Solomon in a lam biehinn adung tong sawmguh hi a, avai tong sawmni pha-in, a sanna tong sawmthum a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biehinn laikim mai-a talaap pen biehinn vailam tawh kikimin tong sawmni pha a, inn mai lamah a thuhna tong sawm pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in biehinn adingin vathang nei tawlette a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in biehinn pang tuoh le a sunglam biehinn kawm kimkotin a kawm tungah inn lam a, tua gel in a laikim le mun siengtho sungnung nei tuoh uhi; tuale ama in a kimkotah inndante zong bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khan neita pen tong nga zai a, a laita pen tong guh, le a thumna tong sagi zai hi. Kawm sungah innkam a lut lo nadingin ama in inn pulam pang kimkot adingin a nanna singpehte bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehinn a kilam laitahin sehta ging hile, hei ging hile, sia vanzah ging khat popo a kizah lo nadingin, suongkhuh-a kilemsa suongte tawh biehinn kilam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biehinn hlang lamah inn khan laita pen ading lutna kot kibawl hi: A khan laita penah kalei kuol tawh kikato a, a khan laita pen panin a thumna-ah kikato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in inn lam a, tuale a man sieng hi; ama in innkamte hlungin a tungkhu dingin taamtah singpehte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a inn buppi tungah a lambete zomin a khan khat ciengin tong nga ta sang a, taamtah singte-in a biehinn tawh kizom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in Solomon tungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na inn lam tami biehinn tawh kisai-in ka thukhamte zui-in ka ngaina kipte mang a, ka thupiehte zosie kemcingin tuate na zui leh, nang tungah keima in na pa David tunga ka kamciemna kang kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mite lahah ka teng ding a, ka mi Israel-te ka nuasie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Solomon in inn lamin a man sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in taamtah singpehte tawh innsung kawm dap hi; tuong panin innciing dong le innku dongin a sunglam teng taamtah singpeh dap hi; tuale a tuong pen taapi singpeh tawh a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tuong panin innku dong innsia lam tong sawmni taamtah singpehte tawh lam a, tuale tami siengtho pen mun, mun siengtho sungtawng dingin a inn sungah a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mun siengtho sungtawng mai-a innsung pen tong sawmli sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Inn sunga taamtah singte umga le pape pallun bangin kizempawl hi; a unpi-in taamtah sing ngentang hi a, suong kici kimu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong koi nadingin a sungtawng penah mun siengtho sungtawng bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mun siengtho sungtawng pen tong sawmni sau-in tong sawmni ma zai a, tong sawmni sang hi; ama in tua pen kham citah tawh zutmam hi; ama in taamtah sing maitam khat zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon in kham citah tawh inn sunglam zutin, tua ciengin mun siengtho sungtawng mai lamah kham khainieng kipaivei-in hlung a, kham tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua banah biehinn buppi kham tawh zutzol a, ama in a unpi-a a nuzol masangsie a nunu hi; mun siengtho sungtawng a maitam buppi nangawn zong kham tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in mun siengtho sungtawngah cherub lim ni olive sing tawh bawl a, tong sawm tuoh sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cherub a hla langkhat, tong nga sau-in, cherub a hla alang dang khat, tong nga ma sau hi; a hla langkhat mong panin a mong langkhat dong tong sawm pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cherub khat pen zong tong sawm ma pha hi; cherub tegel a sauna le a piendan gel a kithakhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cherub khat a sandan tong sawm hi a, a khat zong tua za ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in inn sungtawng penah tua cherub-te tung hi; cherub tegel’ hla tuoh kizah a, khat’ hla in kawm banin, adang khat pen’ hla in zong kawm langkhat ban hi; inn laikimah a hla langkhat gel kisutuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in cherub tegel kham tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a sunglam le a pulam innkhante a kimkotin innkawm zosie tungah cherub-te, lutu kung le pape limte tawh zemsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A sunglam le a pulam inndan sunga tuongte zong kham tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in mun siengtho sungtawng lut nadingin olive sing kotpi pehte bawl hi; bangtung zawl le kotpi khuomte in ning nga nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in cherub-te, lutu kung le pape lim kibawlte tawh olive sing kotpi nite a tuom hi; ama in cherub-te le lutu kungte tungah kham a zutmam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ma bangin ama in inn sung lut nadingin ning li a nei olive sing kotkhuomte bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />taasing kot peh ni zong bawl hi. Kot peh nite kihlip thei a, adang kot peh nite zong kihlip thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua a kotpehte tungah ama in cherub milimte, lutu kung milimte, le pape limte tawh zem a, a zepnate kham tawh a zutmam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in a kikheng suong guol thum le taamtah singzawl guol khat tawh a tuol sungta pen bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A kum lina, Ziv hla-in Topa’ inn khuombul kiphut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kum sawm le khatna, a hla gietna Bul hla-in a inn khan zosie le a kigen zosie bangin innpi lam kihiel bawl hi. Ama in kum sagi sung tua inn a lam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in ama’ inn ding kum sawm le kum thum sung lam a, a inn buppi-in a man sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Lebanon Gammang Inn khat lam a, adung tong zakhat, avai tong sawmnga, a sanna tong sawmthum pha a, taamtah khuompi guol thum tungah taamtah innkam kihlungin tua tunga kilam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Guol khatah sawm le nga a om khuompi sawmli le nga tunga kilam inndan tungson teng taamtah sing tawh kikhu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pang kawm tegel tungah tawlet guol thum tuoh om a, a tawlet guol thumte khatlekhat kimaingat ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kotpi zosie le kotpi khuomte zosie a pang kikim ning li nei vive hi a, a guol thumin tawlet khatlekhat kimaingat ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in adung tong sawmnga, avai tong sawmthum a pha Khuompi Kikhopna kici khat a lam hi. A mai lamah innhlap om a, tua in khuompite nei-in tuate mai-ah a tungkhu khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a thukhennate a tangko nadingin Thutang Tokhom kici Kumpi Tokhom Innpi khat lam a, a tuong panin a innku cieng dong taamtah sing tawh kituom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Innpi nua lamah ama’ ten nading inn zong tua ma bangin kilam hi. Solomon in a zi dinga a lah Pharaoh’ tanu om nadingin tuami innpi bang ma khat zong a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng zosie, a khuombul pan a khum dong, biehinn tuol pan leituol golpi dongin a kite banga kitan, a nua le a mai suong-at tawh a ki-at suong manphate tawh kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khuombul pen suong manpha ngentang hi a, tong giet panin tong sawm a pha suong lienpi vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tung lamah a kite banga a kitan a manpha suongte le taamtah sing om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leituol golpi in a kimvelah suong kikhengsa guol thum simin taamtah sing guol khat nei hi; tua ma bangin Topa’ biehinn tuol sungnung le talaap in zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in Kumpi Solomon in Tyre panin Hiram hlanin a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama pen Naphtali minam meigongnu’ tapa ahi a, a pa Tyre mi sumngo khen nasep a sempa ahi hi; ama pen sumngo nasepna-ah siemna, theina, le pilna tawh kidim hi. Solomon kungah ama pei-in sep ding zosie sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in sumngo khuompi ni a sung hi. Khuompi khat tong sawm le tong giet sang a, a khuom pum kimkot tong sawm le tong ni pha hi; khuom a nina zong tua za ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuompi tegel dawn a bul dingin a kisung sumngo khuom luzepna ni zong a bawl hi; khuom luzepna khat tong nga sang a, adang khuom luzepna khat tong nga ma sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuom luzepna tegel a zep nadingin lenta banga kiphan sumngo khainieng bawl hi; khuom luzepna khat adingin tuate sagi, adang khuom luzepna khat adingin sagi ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mang kawlsing ga limte tunga om khuom luzepna tuom nadingin lenta banga kiphante’ kimvelah khuomte guol ni-in bawl hi; ama in khuom luzepna dang khatah tua ma bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Talaap khuompi dawn a om khuomlu zepnate tong li sangin unoh pa lim tawh kizem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuompi tegel tungah lenta banga kiphan gei-a om a dawh bem tungah khuomlu zepnate kikoi hi; a kimvelah guol ni-in mang kawlsing ga zani om hi; a khuomlu zepna dang khatah zong tua bang ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in biehinn talaap-ah khuompite phut hi. Leitaw lamah khuom khat phut hi; ama in a min Jachin phuoh hi. Ama in leilu lamah khuom dang khat phut a, a min Boaz phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuompite dawnah unoh pa kibawl lim om hi. Tua bangin khuompite a bawl kiman sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a kisung tuikuong pi khat bawl hi; tua tuikuong pen a bem hi a, a gei khat panin a gei khat tong sawm pha a, tong nga thuhin a kimkot tong sawm thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A geiviel nei-ah tuikuongpi kimvelin tong sawm ciet a pha a khawhte a om hi; tua a khawhte guol ni pha a, a tuikuongpi tawh kisuntha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawngtang sawm le nite tungah tuikuongpi kikhang a, thum leilu lam nga a, thum nitumna lam nga-in, thum leitaw lam nga a, tuale thum in nisuona lam nga hi; tua teng tungah tuikuongpi kikoi hi. A nua lam ciet un a sung lam a nuangat dimdiem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tuikuongpi khutphang cie-in sa hi; a geiviel pen unoh pa tawh kibang hai geiviel bangin kibawl hi; tua sungah tui bath tulni bang ta thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in sumngo tawh kibawl tui kuong tunna sawm zong bawl hi; tuate tong li sau, tong li gol, tong thum sang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tunnate tam banga kibawl ahi hi: Tuate in a geizepna nei hi; a geizepnate a kungah kibul hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a kunga kibul a geizepnate tungah humpite, bawngtangte, le cherub-te om hi. Tua a kungte tung, humpite le bawngtangte tung le nei-ah a geiguol a sawi-a kizem pakuolte zong om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tunna khat ciet in sumngo lengpeite le sumngo lengpei zawl li nei hi; a ning lite-ah tuikuongpi nannate a om hi. Tua a nannate a kisung ahi a, a pang cietah pakuolte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A gong pen a tunna panin tong khat sang to hi; a gong pen a tunna a kibawl bangin bem a, tong khat le alang thuh hi; a gongah lim kigielte om hi; a khawhte sih li nei-in kibawl a, a bem hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A geizepnate nei-ah a lengpei li a om hi; a tunnate tungah a lengpei zawlte a om hi; a lengpeite tong khat le alang sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lengpeite sakol leengpei bangin kibawl hi; a pei zawl, a peikuol, a peikalna, le a kalna bulte zosie pen a kisung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A tunna ning cietah a nanna li ciet om hi; tua a nannate pen a tunnate tawh sakhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tunna dawnah tong lang a sang vielbem khat om hi; a tunna dawnah a kipsahnate le a geizepnate a tunna tawh sa khat a kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A kipsahnate le a geizepnate tungah mun awngza ciet tawh kizui-in cherub-te, humpite, le lutu kungte tawh zemin a kimvelah pakuol a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in tam bangin a tunna sawm a bawl hi; a unpi-in a kibangin kisung a, a golna le a lim a mel a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in sumngo tuikuong sawm bawl hi; tuikuong khatah tui bath sawmli bang ta hi; tua tuikuong khat pen tong li ciet ahi hi; a tunna sawm adingin tuikuong khat ciet a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in biehinn leitaw lamah tua a tunnate nga koi a, leilu lamah nga ma koi hi; ama in biehinn hlanglam nisuona lam ningah tuikuongpi koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hiram in beelte, kawbiate, le kuong te zong bawl hi. Tuaci’n Hiram in Kumpi Solomon adingin Topa’ biehinn lam nasep zosie a man sieng hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khuompi nite, khuompite dawn a kuong tawh kibang a lubawh ni, le khuompite dawn a kuong tawh kibang a lubawh nite tuom nadingin len banga a kiphan nite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />len banga kiphan nite adingin mang kawlsing ga zali, khuompite dawn a kuong tawh kibang a lubawh nite tuom nadingin len banga kiphan khat adingin mang kawlsing ga guol ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />a tunna sawm, a tunnate tunga om tui kuongpi sawm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />tui kuongpi khat, le tui kuongpi nei-a om bawngtang sawm le nite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Beelte, kawbiate, le kuongte, Hiram in Topa’ biehinn sungah Solomon dinga a bawl tam vanzah zosie pen a te silsel sumngo vive-a kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kumpipa in Jordan zanglei, Succoth le Zarethan kikal beel lei-a a sunsah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Solomon in tua vante zosie a tam seng ziehin tawite zo lo hi; tua sumngo gihna za kithei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuaci’n Solomon in Topa’ biehinn sunga vanzah vannuoi a bawl hi: kham maitam, Ompina Anlum ading kham sabuoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />mun siengtho sungtawng mai, leitaw lam pangah nga omin, leilu lam pangah nga a om kham citah meivah khuomte, kham tawh kibawl papete, meivahte, le taitete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />panamtui ading haite, taitete, kuongte, pakante, le kham citah vutluona; siengtho pen mun biehinn sungtawng pena kotte le biehinn laikima kotte ading kham kotbilte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Kumpi Solomon in Topa’ biehinn a lamna zosie kiman sieng hi. Solomon in a pa David’ siensuosa ngun, kham le vanzahte peipi-in Topa’ biehinn sunga gou kholna-ah tuate a khol hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong puoto dingin Zion a kici David khuopi panin Jerusalem khuo sunga Kumpi Solomon mai-ah Israel upate le minam lutang zosie le Israel pupa innkuon makaite a kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hla sagina Ethanim hla sung pawi hunin Israel mite zosie Kumpi Solomon kungah a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel upa zosie pei-in siempute in singkuong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Topa’ singkuong, kikhopna puonbuh, le puonbuh sunga om a siengtho vanzah zosie a peito pi uhi; siempute le Levi-te in tuate a puoto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon le a mai-a kikhawm Israel mi buppi in biehpiehna dingin singkuong mai-ah tuu le bawngtang tampi a pieh ziehun tuate a phaza kisim zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempute in Topa’ thuciemna singkuong pen a kikoi nading mun biehinnpi sunga mun siengtho sungtawng, siengtho pen mun, cherub-te’ hlalim nei-ah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherub gel in singkuong tungah a hla a zah ziehun tua cherub gel pen singkuong le a zawlte’ tungkhu a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zawlte sau mama ahi ziehin mun siengtho sungtawng mai-a siengtho pen mun panin a zawl mongte a kimu tabo hi; hinanle a pulam panin kimu lo hi; tuni dongin khum sontah ma-ah tua zawl tegel a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Singkuong sungah Egypt gam panin a pei lai-un Topa in Israel-te tawh thuciemna a bawlna ahi Horeb-ah Moses in suongpeh ni a na koite sim lo bangma dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siengtho mun panin siempute a pusuo ciengun Topa’ biehinnpi meii in tuom a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua meii ziehin siempute in na a sem thei sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ minthanna vang in Topa’ biehinn a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in, “ Topa in khuomiel sapi lahah a ten ding gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in nangma adingin a kitawisang inn khat, kumtawn na ten nading mun khat ka lam zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm Israel-te zosie a din laitahun kumpipa kihei-in thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka pa David tunga a kam tawh a ciemsa teng a tangtungsah Israel Pasien Topa in thupha nga taheh. David in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Egypt pan ka mi Israel-te ka peipi ni-a patin khum munah ka min a op zing nadingin Israel minamte lahah biehinn khat lam nading khuopi khat zong ka teel sih hi; hinanle ka mi Israel-te a uh dingin David ka teel hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel Pasien Topa’ min dingin biehinn khat lam ding ka pa David in a na lung bat zo ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle Topa in ka pa David kungah, ‘Keima’ min dinga biehinn khat lam na sawm khu thu hoi ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hinanle nang in tua biehinn na lam sih ding a, nang tung pana ang pieng ding na tapa in keima’ min dingin tua biehinn lam ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in Topa in a bawlsa a thuciemna a tudet hi; azieh pen ka pa David tangin kei ka khang hi; Topa ciemsa bangin Israel kumpi topha tungah to-in Israel Pasien, Topa’ min dingin biehinn ka lam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Egypt gam panin amate ka peipi lai-in i pu i pate tawh a bawl Topa’ thuciemna opna singkuong adingin mun khat ka bawlpieh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm Israel zosie’ opna Topa’ maitam mai-ah Solomon dingin van lamah a khutte a zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in, “Israel Pasien Topa aw, tunga om vantungah hile, nei-a om leitungah hile, a lungsim zosie tawh na mai-ah gamta-in na nasemte tungah thuciemna a tudet le itna kip a lah, nangma tawh a kibang Pasien a om sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />nang in ka pa David tunga na gensa thuciemna na kipsah hi; na kam tawh na kamciem a, tuni-in na khut tawh na tangtungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel’ Pasien Topa aw, ama kungah, ‘Keima mai-ah nang na gamtat bangin na tapate in keima mai-ah a gamtat vua, a pei nading uh lampi a etsiem nah po uleh keima mai-ah Israel kumpi topha tunga a to ding mi na kitasam ngai sih ding uhi,’ ci-in nangma in na nasempa David na kamciem tukip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel Pasien aw, na nasempa ka pa David kunga na thugensa na kamciem kipsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hinanle Pasien leitungah a teng tahtah diei mah? Vantung le vantung a sangpen nangawn in nang hing dawl lo ahile keima lamsa tami biehinn in bangza-in nang hing dawl lo zaw kan lai ding ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na nasempa’ thungetna le ang thumna ei thudon inlen, Topa ka Pasien aw, tuni-a na nasempa in na mai-a ang ngetna, a kikona le a thungetna ei ngai in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Khum sungah ka min a om ding hi,’ na cina mun biehinn lam sun le zanin en zing inlen, tam muna keima na nasempa thungetnate ei za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in tami mun lam nga-in thu a nget ciengun na nasempa le na mi Israel-te’ thumna ngai in; na tenna vantung panin ei za inlen, ka mawna uh ei ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“A vengpa tungah mi khat maw-in ama a kiciemsah a, ama pei-in tam biehinn sung na maitam mai-ah a kiciem leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />vantung panin za-in sem inlen, na nasemte tungah thukhenin a mawpa thuohsahin ama’ gamtatna ama lukhuh sah inlen, a dih mipa a dihna talangin a dihna tawh kizui-in thaman pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Nangma tungah ang maw ziehun galte mai-ah na mi Israel a guollel ciengin, amate nangma lamah ang kihei kia-in na min ang law vua, tami biehinn sungah thu ngenin na tunga ang thum uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />vantung panin za-in na mi Israel’ mawna ngaidam inlen, a pu a pate tunga na piehsa leitangah amate tunpikia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Nang tunga ang maw ziehun vankot kikhahin guo a zuh nawn lo ciengin, tam mun lamah thu ngenin na min ang law vua, amate dan na pieh ziehin a mawna panun a kiheikia uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />vantung panin za inlen na nasemte, na mi Israel’ mawna ngaidam in; tuale lamate zui ding lampi hoi na hil ciengin na mite tungah a luo ding vua na piehsa leitang tungah guo zusah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Gam sungah kielpi tungin, pul natna hile, ankung natna hile, ankung zawngkhalna hile, kauphe hile, lung hile ang op a; a galte in amau’ khuopi khat popo kuikhumin, bangbang gimna, bangbang natna hile;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />mi khatguoh in hile, na mi Israel-te zosie in hile, a lungsim natna uh thei-in tami biehinn lamah amate in a khutte uh zahin bangbang thungetna hile bangbang thumna hile ang bawl uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />na tenna vantung panin za inlen ngaidam in. Tua ciengin amau’ gamtatna zosie tawh kizui-in amau’ lungsim na thei bangin hing bawl in. Azieh pen nangma beh in mihing lungsim na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka pu ka pate tunga na piehsa leitang tungah a hin sung zosie uh amate in nang ang zatah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Tua ma bangin na mi Israel ahi lo gamdang mi khat nangma min ziehin khuol gamla panin ang pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />(azieh pen amate in a lien mama na min, na banhat, le na banzahnate a za ding uhi), tami biehinn lamah thu ang nget ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />nangma in na tenna vantung panin za inlen, tua gamdang mipa in nang tunga ang ngetna zosie tawh kizui-in bawl in. Na mi Israel bangin leitung mi zosie in na min hing thei-in ang zatah nading le ka lamsa tami biehinn nangma’ min tawh a kilo zo ahina amate in a thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“A galte do dingin na mite kuonin, bang lam bang lamah amate sawl ta lacin, na teelsa khuopi lam, Topa kung le nangma’ min dinga ka lamsa biehinn lamah thu ang nget vua ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />van tung panin a thungetna ule a thumna uh za-in amau’ vai panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Amate na tungah ang maw vua - bangzieh ahei cile a maw lo koima om lo hi - amate tungah na lungthah a, galte khut sungah amate pie-in, amate kimanin tua galte a gamla ah ahi a, a nai ah ahi zongin a kikai mang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />ahi vangin sal dinga a kipeipina gam sungah khuo phawhin a kisiakia a, ‘Kohaw ka maw ta vua, gitlo gamtatin ka khansie ta uhi,’ ci-in a leitang panun na tungah ang thum vua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />amate sala a zawpi a galte’ leitangah a ngaisutna zosie ule a lungsim zosie utawh kisiakia-in, nangma in na teelsa khuopi, a pu a pate uh na piehsa amau’ leitang, le na min dinga ka lamsa biehinn lam nga-in na kunga thu ang nget uleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />vantung na tenna panin a thu ngetna ule a thumna uh za-in, amau’ vai-ah panpi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />tua ciengin na tunga ang maw na mite le na tunga ang gamtanate ule amau’ thupalsatnate zosie maisah inlen, a galte in amate tungah lainatna a nei thei nadingin a mitmu-un amate tungah lainatna nei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />(Azieh pen amate, Egypt sia meiphuol sung pana na peipi nangma’ mi le nangma’ gouluo ahi uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na nasempa thumna le na mi Israel thumna mittuhna-in nei inlen, amate in nang ang hlat sielun na bil na ngat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt panin ka pu ka pate na peipi lai-in na nasempa Moses tungtawnin na kamciemsa bangin na gouluo ahi dingin leitung mi zosiete lah panin amate na tel zo hi, Topa Pasien aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tu-in Topa tungah Solomon in tami thungetnate le tami thumnate zosie a khan zaw ciengin vantung lamah a khutte zahsa-in a khupdinna mun Topa’ maitam mai panin ama a dingto hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />ama dingin awging tawh a kikhawm Israel mi zosie thupha pie hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“A ciemsa zosie dung zui-in a mipi Israel tungah tawlngahna a pie Topa in minthanna nga taheh; ama in a nasempa Moses tung tawna a gensa thuciem hoite zosie khat zong a kipel om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />I pu i pate tawh a na opton bangin eite tawh Topa i Pasien hing om taheh; ama in eite ei nuasie loin ei taisan sih heh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />ahi vangin ama in i pu i pate a thupiehsa ama’ lampi zosie a zui ding, le ama’ thupiehnate, a thukhamte, le a ngaina kipte a zui dingin i lungsimte ama lamah hawisah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Topa mai-ah keima’ thumna kammalte sun le zanin Topa i Pasien nai-ah omin, ama in nisielin a kisam bangin a nasempa’ vai le a mi Israel’ vai ei panpi taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />tuaci’n leitung mi zosie in Topa pen Pasien hi, ci-in a thei ding uhi; koima adang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa i Pasien tungah noma ma ki-ap unlen tuni-a bangin a thukhamte zui-in a thupiehnate mang un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa, le ama tawh a om Israel mi zosie in Topa mai-ah biehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Solomon in thunuom biehna dingin Topa tungah bawngtang tul sawmni le tulni le tuu tul zakhat le tul sawmni a pie hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa le Israel mi zosie in Topa’ biehinnpi a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Kumpipa in khum ni ma-in Topa’ biehinn mai-a om inntuol laikimteng a siensuo hi; azieh pen meihal biehnate, an tawh biehnate, le thunuom biehpiehna’ thaute adingin Topa’ mai-a om sumngo maitam neu luo-in dawl zo ta lo ahi ziehin tua munah meihal biehnate, an tawh biehnate le thunuoma biehna thaute a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum hun lai-in Solomon le a ompi Israel mi zosie in Topa i Pasien mai-ah ni sagi sung, Hamath panin Egypt Lui dongin kikhopna thupi mama khat bawlin pawi a khaam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ama in a ni giet ni-in mite a peisah hi; amate in kumpipa thupha pie-in Topa in ama’ nasempa David le ama’ mi Israel tungah migitna a lahna zosie ziehin lungdamna le kipahna tawh a inn ciet a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Topa biehinn le kumpi inn lam zo ta a, a lam nop zosie a lam zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon-a ama kunga a kilahsa bangin Solomon tungah Topa a niveina kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Nangma in keima kunga na thungetna le na thumnate ka za zo hi; keima in tam na lamsa biehinn ka siensuo zo a, khum sungah keima’ min a tawntungin ka koi zo ta hi; khum mun ka mit suon den ding a, ka lungsim ka tengsah den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma na hi leh, ka mai-ah na pa David gamtat bangin lungsim citah le thutang tawh na gamtat a, kang thupieh zosie semin ka thukhamte le ka ngaina kipte na zui nah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />keima in na pa David kungah, ‘Israel kumpi topha tunga to ding mi na kitasam ngai sih ding hi,’ ci-a ka na ciemsa bangin Israel-te tungah na kumpi topha ka kipsah peisuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma na hi a, na tate ahi zongin, keima nei zuina uh panin pielmangin, na mai vua ka koi ka thupiehnate le ka thukhamte na zui sih vua, pasien dangte’ na a sem ding le a bie dingin na pei uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />keima in ka piehsa gam panin Israel ka notmang ding hi; tuale keima’ muna panin ka min dinga ka siensuosa tuami biehinn ka paimang ding a, mi zosie lahah Israel pen paunah le zakona-in kinei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami biehinn buathah lom suohin a gei-a suoh kha zosie in datmaw-in a ehneh ho ding uhi; tuale amate in, ‘Bang dinga Topa in tami gam le tami biehinn tam banga a bawl tah lawm adiei?’ a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Egypt gam panin a pu a pate a peipi Topa a Pasien uh taisanin pasien dangte a pom vua, amate in tuate bie-in a na a seppieh zieh uh ahi hi; tua ahi ziehin amate tungah Topa in tam gimna a tunsah ahi hi,’ ci ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon in inn nite, Topa’ biehinn le kumpi inn a lam zaw kum sawmni a cin kumin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tyre Kumpipa Hiram in Solomon’ dei zaza taamtah sing, taa sing le khamte a sih zaw ciengin, Kumpi Solomon in Galilee gam sunga khuopi sawmni Hiram a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle Solomon’ pieh khuopite en dingin Tyre panin Hiram a zin ciengin tua teng in ama lungkimsah zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ziehin ama in, “Ka sanggam aw, kei nei pieh tam khuopite bangci khuopi dan bep ahei?” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tuni dongin tuate Cabul gam kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle kumpipa tunga Hiram in a pieh kham talent zakhat le talent sawmni pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam pen Topa’ biehinn, ama’ inn, Millo le Jerusalem kulpi, le Hazor, Megiddo, le Gezer-te lam nadinga Solomon in aana tawh a sepsah thalut teng tuotna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Egypt kumpi Pharoah peito-in ama in Gezer la-in mei tawh haltum a, khuopi sunga teng Canaan-te thatin Solomon’ zi ahi ama’ moken dinga tua khuopi a pieh ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaci’n Solomon in Gezer lamphakia hi). Bethhoron neinung pen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baalath, le khum gamsung senel gamah Tamar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />le Solomon’ vankholna khuopite zosie, le leengte ading khuopite, sakol galkapte ading khuopite, le Jerusalem sung, Lebanon sung, le ama’ uhna gam sung zosie-ah zong Solomon in a lam nop popo a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mi ahi lo Amor-te, Hit-te, Perez-te, Hiv-te, le Jebus-te sung panin a omlai mi zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-te in a tha sieng zo lo, tua gam sungah amau’ nua-a omlai a suonlehlahte, Solomon in thona aana sem dingin a lah ziehin tuni dongin tua bang ma-in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle Solomon in Israel-te salin a bawl sih hi; amate pen galkapte, ama’ uliente, ama’ galkapmangte, ama’ galkap bute, sakol leengte le sakol galkap uhte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam teng Solomon’ inn lam nasep a uh ulienpite ahi uhi: nasep a uh ulienpite mi zanga le sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin David khuopi panin Solomon in ama dinga a lam a inn ah Pharaoh’ tanu a peito hi; tua ciengin ama in Millo a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa dinga Solomon in a lam maitam tungah meihal biehnate le thunuom biehpiehnate kum khatin thumvei pie a, ama in Topa mai-ah gimnamtui a hal hi. Tuaci’n ama in biehinn lam a man sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon in Edom gam sung San Tuipi dunga om Eloth kici mun nai-a Ezion-geber ah tembaw honkhat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiram in tembaw honte tawh a nasemte, tuipi tung nasep a kiva tembaw nasemte, le Solomon’ nasemte tawh a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ophir ah amate pei-in tuatah panin kham talent zali le sawmni a puo vua, kumpi Solomon kungah tuate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon’ minthanna a zah ciengin, (Topa’ min zieha a minthanna) thudawhna hamsate tawh a ma zelah dingin ama kungah haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A namtui nate, kham tampi le suong manphate a puo kalaohte, le ama’ nuazui honpite tawh Jerusalem ah tua nu pei hi; tuale ama Solomon kung a tun ciengin a lungsim sunga om zosie a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in tua nu thudawh zosie a unpi-in a dawng hi; Kumpipa in tua nu tungah a gencien thei lo thuhamsa khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon’ pilna, a lamsa a inn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a sabuoi-a kilui an, a uliente tona, le a nasemte’ kep le khoi dan, a puonsil a nihtente uh, ama an a piete, le Topa’ inn sunga meihal biehna zosiete a mu ciengin a hla tawh zong teng nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in kumpipa kungah, “Keima in ka gam panin na sepsate le na pilna thu kigen ka zahte a man ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />hinanle pei-in tua thu kigente ka mit tawh ka mu masangsie ka tahsang sih hi. Keima kungah alang nangawn ang kigen nai sih hi; na pilna le na hauna in ka zah thute a khupsin sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na zite mi hampha ahi uhi! Nangma hing khoi-in nangma’ pilna a tawntunga a za den tam nasemte zong mi hampha ahi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma tungah lungkimin Israel kumpi topha tunga ang tosah Topa na Pasien in thupha nga taheh! Topa in Israel a it zing ziehin nangma in thutang le thuman na sep thei nadingin ama in kumpi-in nang ang bawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu in kumpipa tungah kham talent za le sawmni, le gimnamtui tampi le suong manphate a pie hi. Sheba kumpinu in Kumpi Solomon tunga a pieh za-a a tam gimnamtuite a kipuoh ngai nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua tham loin Ophir panin kham a puo Hiram’ tembaw honte in Ophir panin cingsing le suong manpha tampitah a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua cingsingte Topa’ biehinn le kumpipa’ inn dona-in zang a, lasate ading lyre lasahna le harp lasahna-in zong a bawl hi; tua bang cingsingte tuni dongin kipuoh ngai nawn lo a, zong kimu ngai nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum hun sungin Kumpi Solomon in kumpi letsongte a pieh banah ama in a dei a nget zosie zong Sheba kumpinu tungah a pie hi. Tua ciengin a nasemte tawh a gam zuonin tua nu a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum simin Solomon kunga a tung kham a gihna talent zaguh le sawmguh le guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua banah summet bawlte le sumbuhte, Arabia kumpite le gamsung uhpite tung pana a peite zong omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon in a kikheng kham tawh kibawl lum a gol zani bawl hi; lum a gol khat bawlna-ah kham shekel zaguh lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a kikheng kham tawh a kibawl lum zathum bawl hi; lum khat ciengin kham mina thum ta lut hi; tuale kumpipa in Lebanon Gamlah Inn a kici sungah tua lumte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa in saiha tawh kumpi topha golpi khat zong bawl a, kham hoipente tawh tua topha zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpi topha in kalei ciel guh nei hi. Kumpi topha tunglam pen a nualamah a bemin kibawl a, a tona pang tuohah ban ngahnate omin tua ban ngahnate pangah humpi ni a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kalei ciel guh’ mong cietah khat ciet a om humpi sawm le ni a ding hi. Koima’ kumpi gam sungah tam banga kibawl kumpi topha om ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon’ tuidawnna hai zosiete kham tawh kibawl ahi a, Lebanon Gamlah Inn sunga kizang kuong le beel zosie zong kham tawh kibawl vive hi a, ngun tawh kibawl khat beh om lo hi; Solomon hun lai-in ngun pen bangma-in kisim lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen kumpipa in Tarshish tembaw honpi khat nei a, tuipi tungah Hiram’ tembaw honte tawh a peiton vua, kum thum a cin sielin Tarshish tembaw honte khatvei ta pei-in kham, ngun, saiha, zawngmang, le utongte puoh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua bangin Kumpi Solomon in a hauna le a pilna tawh leitung kumpi zosie a khupsin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasien in a lungsim sunga a guot a pilna ngai dingin leitung buppi in Solomon’ opna a leisui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama kunga a haw mi zosie in a kumkumin letsong, ngun le kham tawh kibawl nate, puonsilte, galvante, gimnamtuite, sakolte, le laa-sakolte tampi puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in leengte le sakol tung tuongte khawm hi; ama in leeng tul le zali tuonna sakol tul sawm le tulni nei a, leeng koina khuopite le Jerusalem-a kumpipa’ opna munah tuate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa in Jerusalem ah ngun suong bangin olsahin Shephalah-a theitheh sing bangin vausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon sakol leina gam pen Egypt gam le Kue gam hi a, kumpipa’ sumbawlte in Kue gamah a manpie-in a lei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Egypt panin leeng khat ngun shekel zaguh, sakol khat shekel za le sawmnga-in kinga hi; tuaci’n kumpipa’ sumbawlte tungtawnin Hit-te’ kumpite zosie le Aram-te’ kumpite kungah tuate kizuasawn hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Solomon in Pharaoh’ tanu banah gamdang numei tampi deigaw hi: Moab-te, Ammon-te, Edom-te, Sidon-te, le Hit numeite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te kungah, “Amate tawh na kinung sih ding vua, amate zong note tawh a kinung sih ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in a pasien uh’ nua na zui nadingun na lungsim uh ang hawisah tahtah ding hi,” ci-a na gensa minamte sung pan hi a, Solomon in tam mite ngai-in a pom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ zite lahah kumpi tanu zi za sagi, le mei zathum nei hi; tuale a zite in ama’ lungsim a heipieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Solomon a vuoi ciengin a zite in pasien dangte lamah ama’ lungsim heipieh uhi; a pa David’ lungsim bangin ama’ lungsim Topa a Pasien tungah dih zo nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Solomon in Sidon-te’ nusien Asterte, le a kidahhuoi Ammon-te’ bieh Milcom nua a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa muna-ah Solomon siet gamtat a, a pa David bangin Topa zui tahtah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon in Jerusalem nisuona lam muol tungah Moab-te-a’ ahi a kidahhuoi Chemosh le a Ammon-te-a’ ahi a kidahhuoi Molech dingin mun sang khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in gimnamtui halin amau’ pasien-te tungah biehpiehna a pie a gamdang zi zosie dingin tua bang ma-in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kunga ni veitah kilahsa Topa , Israel Pasien panin a lungsim a heimang ziehin Solomon tungah Topa a lungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua pasien dangte’ nua a zui lo nadingin ama tungah thu a piehsa ahi hi; hinanle ama in Topa’ thupieh bangin zui lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in Solomon kungah, “Tam pen nangma’ lungsim puoh ahi a, nangma kang thupieh ka thuciemna le ka thukhamte na zui lo ziehin nangma tung panin na kumpi gam balkehin na nasempa tungah ka pie tahtah ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin na pa David ziehin nangma’ hin sungin ka bawl sih ding hi; na tapa’ khut sung panin ka balkeh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongnanle keima in tua kumpi gam buppi ka balkeh sih ding hi; ka nasempa David zieh le ka teelsa Jerusalem ziehin na tapa tungah minam khat ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Solomon a langpang dingin Topa in Edom-te Hadad a khangsah hi; ama pen Edom kumpi innsung mi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Edom gamah David a op lai-in misi vui dingin galkapmang Joab kuonto-in Edom gam sunga pasal zosie that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Azieh pen Joab in Edom gama pasal zosie a na thagam masangin khum munah ama le Israel-te zosie hlaguh sung om uhi);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ahi vangin Egypt ah a pa’ nasem Edom-te pawlkhat tawh Hadad a taimang hi. Tua hunin Hadad naupangno khat ahi na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midian panin a ding vua, Paran ah a tung uhi; Paran panin mi a zawpi vua, ama tungah inn le lo, neh le tah le tenna ding leitang a pie Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh kung Egypt gamah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pharaoh’ muna-ah Hadad in maipha lienpi mu a, a zi dingin a nuphalnu, Kumpinu Tahpene’ sanggamnu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahpenes’ sanggamnu in ama tawh tapa Genubath nei a, Tahpenes in Pharaoh’ inn ah tua naupang kem hi; Pharaoh’ inn sunga Pharaoh’ tapate lahah Genubath om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh David lumton a, galkapmang Joab si ta ci thu Hadad in Egypt panin a zah ciengin Hadad in Pharaoh kungah, “Ka gam ka pei thei nadingin ei dingkhie sah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharaoh in ama kungah, “Keima tawh na opna-ah bang kisapna nei-a na gam pei ding na hici sawm ahei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Hi lo hi, ei peisah ta teitei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomon langpang dingin Pasien in adang khat ahi a pupa Zobah kumpi Hadedezer kung pana a tai Eliada’ tapa Rezon a khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David in mi a tha zaw ciengin Rezon in a kimvelah mi kaikhawmin ama misuom pawl’ makai a suoh hi; amate Damascus ah pei-in khum munah a teng vua, tuale Damascus ah ama kumpi a semsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon’ hun sung tawn tungin Israel langpangin ama om a, Hadad ma bangin lungkhamna a piengsah hi; ama in Israel simmaw a, Aram gamsungah a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon’ nasem, Zeredah-a Ephraim-te, Nebat’ tapa, a nu’ min Zeruah kici meigong Jeroboam in kumpipa ledo hi. Ama in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />kumpipa a ledona thu pen tam zieh ahi hi: Solomon in Millo lam a, a pa David’ khuopi kulpi sunga a vangte a hubih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboam a kici pa pen nasep siem khat hi a, tua tangvalpa pen mi kukal khat hi, ci thu Solomon in a mu ciengin Joseph inn sungah thona-aana tawh nasemte uh dingin a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Jerusalem pan Jeroboam a pei ciengin, Shiloh-a kamsangpa Ahijah in lampi-ah ama na dawn hi. Ahijah in puontha khat na sil hi. Ama gel beh gamlahah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahijah in a puon tha-ah manin phal sawm le phal ni a suo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in Jeroboam kungah a gen hi: Nangma dingin phal sawm la in; bang ding ahei cile Israel Pasien Topa in tam bangin ci hi, ‘En in, keima in Solomon’ khut sung panin a kumpi gam ka balkeh ta ding a, nangma tungah minam sawm kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka nasempa David zieh le Israel minamte sung pana ka teelsa khuopi Jerusalem ziehin ama adingin minam khat a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in keima ei nuasie zo a, ama in Sidon-te’ nusien Astarte, Moab-te’ pasien Chemosh, le Ammon-te’ pasien Milcom bie-in ka lampi a zui sih a, ka muna-ah ama a manin gamta loin, a pa David bangin ka thukhamte le ka ngaina kipte a zui sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanle ama kung panin a kumpi gam buppi ka lahpieh sih ding hi; ka thupiehnate le ka thukhamte a zui pa, keima’ teel ka nasempa David vangin ama’ hin sung tungtawnin uhpa-in ama ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama’ tapa tung panin kumpi gam ka la ding a, nangma tungah minam sawm kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanle ka nasempa David in ka min koi nadinga ka teelsa khuopi Jerusalem-a keima’ mai-ah ama in meivah khat a nei den thei nadingin a tapa tungah minam khat ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in nangma hing la-in, na dei zaza tungah na uh ding a, Israel-te tungah kumpi na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka nasempa David bangin ka thukhamte le ka thupiehnate zui-in kang thupieh zosie mangin ka tawndante na zui a, keima’ muna-ah dihtaha na gamtat leh nangma tawh kang omton ding a, David dingin ka lampieh bangin nang dingin zong inndet khat ka lam ding a, keima in nangma tungah Israel kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin David’ suonlehlahte dan ka pie ding a, hinanle a tawntung hi lo ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ziehin Solomon in Jeroboam tha dingin a sui hi; ahi vangin Egypt ah Jeroboam tai-in Egypt kumpi Shishak bel a, Solomon a si dongin Egypt ah a om den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tu-in Solomon’ nasep a omlaite, le a silbawl zosie le a pil a siemna zosie, Solomon’ Nasepna Laibu sungah kigiel sieng zo ta hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Solomon in Jerusalem-a Israel mi zosie tungah a uh hun kum sawmli sung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Solomon lumton a, tuaci’n a pa David khuopi sungah ama kivui hi; tuale a tapa Rehoboam in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama kumpi suohsah dingin Shechem ah Israel mi zosie a pei zo tah ziehun Rehoboam zong a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam in tua thu a zah ciengin (azieh pen Kumpi Solomon kung pan a taina Egypt ah a omlai hi), Egypt panin Jeroboam a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in mi sawlin ama a hlan uhi; tuale Jeroboam le a kikhawm Israel buppi pei-in Rehoboam kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pa in ka hahkol uh a gihsah hi. Tua ziehin tu-in na pa’ nasep a hamsate le kote tunga ei suon a hahkol gihte hing zangsah in. Tua hile nangma’ na ka sem ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in amate kung ah, “Ni thum sung va pei unlen, tua ciengin ka kungah hing peikia un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n mite a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Rehoboam in a pa Solomon hin lai-a a na sem khangham mite hlanin thu kuppi a, “Tam mite ka dawn nadingin ngaisutna bang nei ci pieh ding vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Tuni-in tam mite’ nasem suohin, a na uh nasep a, kam hoino tawh na dawn leh amate na nasem ahi zing ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in khanghamte’ ngaisutna piehte thuse loin tu-a ama’ mai-a ding a khanguol tangvalte po thu a kuppi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “’Na pa in ko tunga ei suon hahkol hing zangsah in,’ ei ci mite bang ka ci dawn diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khanguol tangvalte in ama kungah, “Na kungah, ‘Na pa in ka hahkol uh a gihsah hi, ahi vangin nang in kote adingin hing zangsah in,’ ang ci mite kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi; amate kungah, ‘Ka pa’ kawng sangin ka khutme a sazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in ka pa in na tung vuah hahkol gih ang suon hi. Keima in na hahkol uh kang belap lai ding hi. Ka pa in khauhuol tawh note ang thuhil a, hinanle keima in cieng lingnei tawh note thu kang hil ding hi,’ na ci ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in, “Ni thum ni-in hing peikia un,” a ci ma bangin Rehoboam kungah Jeroboam le mi zosie a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua kumpipa in mite ngawh dawn a, ama in khanghamte’ ngaisutna piehte thuse loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khangnote’ ngaisutna piehna bangin a tung vuah gen a, “Ka pa in na hahkol uh ang gihsah hi, ahi vangin keima in na hahkol uh ka belap ding hi; ka pa in note cieng tawh ang thuhil hi. Keima in cieng lingnei tawh note kang thuhil ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in mite’ thu a ngai sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in Shilon-te Ahijah tungtawnin Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam tunga a gensa thu a tangtun thei nadinga Topa in a piensah thu kiheina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa in a thu uh a ngai lo lamtah Israel zosie in a mu ciengun mite in kumpipa a dawng vua, Kote in David sungah tanh bang ka nei uh ahei? Jessi tapa sungah gamhluo ka nei sih uhi. Israel aw, na puonbuh ah pei in! David aw, tu-in na innsung beh en in,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n a puonbuh ah Israel a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Rehoboam in Judah khuopite sunga teng Israel-te uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi Rehoboam in thona-aana nasemte uhpa Adoram a sawl ciengin Israel zosie in suong tawh ama a seplia uhi. Jerusalem-a tai dingin a sakol leengah kumpi Rehoboam a nawtuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuni dongin Israel in David’ innkuonte a ledo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam a kinuale zo ahi lamtah Israel zosie in a zah bepun amate in zong mi sawlin kikhopna-ah ama hlansah a, Israel zosie tungah kumpi a semsah uhi. Judah minam khat beh simlo David’ innkuonte a zui koima dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Rehoboam a tun ciengin, Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam in kumpi gam a ngakia thei nadingin Israel innkuon sim dingin Judah’ innkuonte zosie le Benjamin minam, a kiteel galkap tul zakhat le tul sawmgiet kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ mipa Shemaiah tungah Pasien’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa, Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam tung, Judah le Benjamin’ innkuon zosiete tung, le a omlai mite tungah gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Topa in tam bangin gen hi, ‘Na kuonto sih ding vua, na sanggam Israel mite na do sih ding uhi. Mi zosie a inn vuah pei uheh. Azieh pen tam thu pen keima kung pan ahi hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in zong Topa’ thu a mang vua, Topa’ thugen bangin inn lam a zuonkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeroboam in Ephraim muoltung gamah Shechem satin khum munah a teng hi; ama khum panin pei-in Penuel a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeroboam in a lungsim sungah, “Tu-in David’ innkuonte tungah kumpi gam kiheikia thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Topa’ biehinn-ah biehpiehna pie dingin tam mite kuonto den uleh a pupa uh Kumpi Rehoboam lamah a lungsim uh kiheikia ding hi; amate in kei ei thatin Judah Kumpi Rehoboam kungah a kilekia ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in mite thu kuppi kawikawi a, kham bawngno lim ni a bawl hi. Ama in mite tungah, “Jerusalem ah sauvei na peito zo ta uhi. Israel mite aw, tamtahah Egypt gam pana ang peipi na pasiente uh a om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in khat Bethel ah koi a, a khat pen Dan ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi kimkhat a bie dingin Bethel ah, adangte Dan cieng dong a pei ziehun tam pen mawna khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in munsangte tungah zong innte lam a, mi zosiete lah panin Levi-te ahi lo mite siempu-in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeroboam in Judah gam sungah pawi kibawl bangin hla giet a cin ni, a ni sawm le nga ni-in pawi khat bawl a, maitam tungah biehpiehnate a pie hi; tuaci’n ama in Bethel ah zong bawlin a bawlsa bawngno milimte tungah biehpiehna a pie hi. Ama in Bethel ah a bawlsa munsang siempute koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hla giet a cin ni, a ni sawm le nga ni, ama beh in a gelna hla sungin Bethel-a a bawlsa maitam ah peito hi; ama in Israel mite adingin pawi khat bawlin gimnamtui hal dingin maitam ah a peito hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gimnamtui hal dingin maitam gei-ah Jeroboam a din laitahin, Topa’ thu tawh Judah panin Bethel ah Pasien’ mipa khat a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien’ mipa in Topa’ thu tawh maitam lang khatah kikozah a, “Maitam, maitam aw, Topa in tam bangin gen hi: ‘David’ innkuon panin Josiah min nei tapa khat ang suoh ding hi; tuale ama in gimnamtui a hal, munsang tunga om siempute nangma tungah siem thoina-in ang pie ding a, mihing’ gute nangma tungah kihal ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in ama in lim khat pie a, “Tami khu Topa in a gensa lim ahi hi: ‘Maitam kiphelkhe ding a, a tunga om vutvamte kithezah ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in Bethel ah maitam a langpan Pasien’ mipa thugen a zah ciengin maitam panin Jeroboam in a khut a zah kawmin, “Ama man un,” ci hi. Ahi vangin ama lama a zah a khut gawta-in a nuadaw thei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ thu tawh Pasien’ mipa in lim khat a piehna tawh kizui-in maitam zong kiphelkhe-in maitam panin vutvamte kithezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa in Pasien’ mipa kungah, “Ka khut a ngai a bah thei nadingin tu-in kei dingin thu ei ngetpieh inlen, Topa na Pasien’ maipha ka nga thei nadingin zong ei thumpieh in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Pasien’ mipa in Topa tungah a thumpieh hi; tuale kumpipa’ khut damin a ngai bangkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Pasien’ mipa kungah, “Innah ei zui inlen an neton vai, keima in letsong khat hing pie vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hizongle Pasien’ mipa in kumpipa kungah, “Na kumpi gam phal khat ei hawm nan lacin na inn ah kang haw sih ding hi; khum munah an zong ne loin tui zong ka dawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam bangin kei thu ei pie hi: An ne loin tuisih zong na dawn sih ding a, na peina lampi zui-in na kilekia sih ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama lampi dangah pei a, Bethel ah ang peina lampi zui-in a kilekia ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bethel ah khum hun lai-in kam sang puvuoi khat a teng hi. A tapate khat pei-in khum ni-a Pasien’ mipa in Bethel ah a sepsa thu teng ama kungah a gen hi; ama in kumpipa kunga a gen thute zong a pa uh kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pa un amate kungah, “Ama hei lamah a pei ta e?” a ci hi. A tapate in Judah gam pana Pasien’ mipa peina lampi a lah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a tapate kungah, “Kei ading laa khat a topha ei vawpieh un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in laa khat a topha a vaw vua, laa tungah ama a tuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Pasien’ mipa nuadel a, gangpi sing nei khatah a to laitah a mu hi. Ama in khumpa kungah, “Judah gam pana ang pei Pasien’ mipa kici nang na hiei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tua pa kungah, “Ka inn ah ei zui inlen an hing ne ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle ama in, “Nang tawh kang kilekia thei sih ding a, na inn sungah zong kang lut thei sih ding hi; tam munah zong nang tawh an ka ne sih ding a, tui zong ka dawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima kungah Topa in tam bangin gen hi: ‘Khum munah an zong ne loin tui zong na dawn sih ding a, na peina lampi lamah nang kilekia sih ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin adang khat in ama kungah, “Kei zong nang banga kamsang khat ka hi a, Topa’ thu tawh vantungmi khat in ka kungah thu ang gen a, “An ne ding le tui dawn dingin na inn ah ama hing zawpikia in,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in khumpa a sol ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tawh Pasien’ mipa kilekia-in a inn ah an ne-in tui a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sabuoi-ah ama gel a to laitahin ama a zawpikia kamsangpa kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale Judah gam pana a pei Pasien’ mipa kungah ama kiko-in, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Nang in Topa’ thugen mang loin Topa na Pasien in na kunga ang gensa thupiehna na zui sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahi vangin ama in na kungah, ‘An ne sinlen tui dawn sin,’ ang cina munah kilekia-in an ne-in tui dawn na hi ziehin na pu na pate’ hanah na luonghawm kivui lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien’ mipa in an ne-in tui a dawn zaw ciengin amate in a zawpikia uh ahi kamsangpa’ laa phaw a vawpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pei laitahin humpi khat in ama na dawntuo-in ama a petlia hi. A luonghawm lampi-ah kipai a, ama’ gei-ah a laa a ding hi; humpi zong a luonghawm gei-ah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite in a nawhkha vua, lampi-ah a luong kipai-in a luong gei-ah humpi a ding a mu uhi. Amate zong pei-in kamsang puvuoi pa tenna khuopi sungah tua thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lamkim pana ama a zawpi kamsangpa in khumi thu a zah cieng in, “Tua pa pen Topa’ thugen a mang lo Pasien’ mipa ahi hi. Tua ahi ziehin Topa in ama kunga a gensa tawh kizui-in Topa in humpi tungah ama pie a, tua in ama ehmalin a tha ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a tapate kungah, “Kei ading laa phaw ei vawpieh un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in khat a vawpieh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ama a va pei ciengin lampi-a a luonghawm kipai le laa le a luonghawm gei-ah humpi a ding a mu hi. Humpi in a luonghawm ne loin a laa zong bangma law lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kamsangpa in Pasien’ mipa’ luonghawm domto-in a laa tungah khang a, kaa ding le vui dingin khuopi sungah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in ama’ hanah tua luonghawm a vui hi; tuale amate in ama uopin a kaa vua, “Kadei, ka sanggampa!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in tua pa a vui zaw ciengin a tapate kungah, “Kei ka si ciengin tua Pasien’ mipa kivuina hanah ei vui un; ama’ gute gei-ah ka gute koi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in Bethel-a maitamte le Samaria khuopite sunga a om munsang tunga kithoina mun zosie’ langkhatah Topa’ thu tawh a thugente tung valon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam thute a pien zaw nangawnin zong a gitlona panin Jeroboam kihei nuom tuon lo a, tua lemahin mi zosie lah panin munsangte tunga siempu sem ding mi a sekia hi; ama in siempu a suoh nuom popo munsangte-a siempu dingin a siensuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tam thu pen lei maitang panin Jeroboam innkuon tungah vatmai ding le suhmang ding a tun mawna a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Jeroboam’ tapa Abijah a cina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jero-boam in a zi kungah, “Pei inlen, Jeroboam’ zi na hi lam ang kithei lo nadingin na mel kisel inlen, Shiloh ah va haw ta’n; azieh pen tam mite tungah kumpi ka hi nadingin keima kunga thu ang gen kamsangpa Ahijah khum sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anlum sawm, moh halkhat le khuoizu thawl khat kengin khum pa kungah va haw ta’n; ama in naupang tunga a pieng ding thu na kungah ang gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua bang ma-in Jeroboam’ zi a gamta hi; ama kithawi-in Shiloh lam zuon a, Ahijah’ inn a tung hi. Tua hunin a kum tam ziehin Ahijah a mit mangin khuo mu thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Ahijah kungah, “A tapa tungtang nang thu ang dong dingin Jeroboam’ zi ang pei hi; azieh pen a tapa a cina hi. Nangma in tua nu kungah tua bang tua bangin na gen ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua nu a tun ciengin numei dang khat a kipang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ahijah in tua nu kotbieng a gei laitah a keng gin a zah ciengin ama in, “Hing lut in, Jeroboam zi aw; bang dinga midang khat kipang na hei? Nang adingin thu hamsa khat ei kiguon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pei inlen Jeroboam kungah gen in, ‘Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Mite lah panin nangma hing domsangin ka mi Israel tungah makai-in kang bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale David’ innkuonte panin kumpi gam balkehin nangma tungah kang pie hi; hinanle ka thupiehnate kemcingin a lungsim zosie tawh keima ei zui-in, ka muna-ah thuman beh tawh a gamta ka nasempa David tawh na kibang sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />na mai-a om mi zosie sangin a sie zaw-in na gamta zo a, vahmangin nang adingin pasien dangte le a kisung milimte na bawl ziehin kei nei lungthahsah a, na nua lam sena-in keima nei nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin mi khat in a tumvam dongin bawng-eh a halvam bangin keima in Jeroboam’ innkuon tungah sietna tungsahin, Jeroboam innkuon panin Israel gama om sal hile, a suohta mi hile, pasal zosie sumangin ka that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeroboam’ mi, khuopi sunga a si popo a sa uite in ne ding hi; tuale gamlaha a si popo vana a leng vate in ne ding hi; azieh pen Topa in gen zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ding inlen na inn lamah pei in. Na keng tawh khuopi sung na tot ciengin tua naupang pa a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel zosie in ama kaa-in a vui ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Jeroboam innkuon sung panin Israel Pasien Topa a lungkimsahna thu ama tungah themkhat a kimu ziehin Jeroboam innkuon sung panin ama beh hanah kivui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua tham loin tu nangawnin zong Topa in Israel tungah ama adingin kumpi khat a khangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tui sunga pumpeng a kithin bangin Topa in Israel a vat ding hi; ama in a pu a pate tunga a pieh tam gamhoi panin Israel phungkal ding a, Euphrates galkhatah a thezah ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile amate in a khuom siengthote uh bawlin Topa lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeroboam’ mawnate le Israel-te a bawlsah mawnate ziehin ama in Israel nuasie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeroboam’ zi tho-in pei a, Tirzah ah a tung hi. Tua nu a inn sangkil a tun laitahin tua naupang a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nasem kamsangpa Ahijah tungtawnin Topa’ thugenna tawh kizui-in Israel zosie in ama kaa-in a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in Jeroboam’ gamtatna omlai teng, a galdona le a gam uhnate, Israel Kumpite’ Khanggui Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam’ maan hun sung kum sawmni le ni ahi hi; tua ciengin a pu a pate tawh ama lumton a, a tapa Nadad in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in Solomon’ tapa Rehoboam in Judah uh hi. Gam a uh patin Rehoboam kum sawmli le khat pha a, ama’ min koi nadinga Topa in Israel minam zosie sung pana a teel khuopi Jerusalem-ah kum sawm le sagi sung uh hi. A nu’ min Naamah ahi a, Ammon-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa’ muna-ah Judah in sietna bawl hi; a pu a pate bawl zosie sangin a tam zaw-in amau’ mawnate tawh ama hazatna dingin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in amate dingin munsangte, biehna songte, khuom siengthote, muolsang zosie le singna dawng zosie tengah khuom siengthote a phut uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tua gam sungah pasal pahtatte zong a om hi. Topa in Israel-te mai-a a delmangsa ahi a kidahhuoi minamte gamtatnate bangin amate a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpi Rehoboam’ a kum ngana kumin Jerusalem sim dingin Egypt kumpi Shishak a kuonto hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ama in Topa’ biehinn sunga goute le kumpipa’ inn sunga goute a unpi-in a tomgam a, Solomon’ bawlsa kham lumte zong a la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuaci’n Kumpi Rehoboam in tua teng tangin sumngo awmphawte bawlin kumpi inn kotcing ahi inncing uliente khut sungah tuate ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sungah kumpipa a pei sielin inncingte in tuate puo-in inncinna khan sungah a koikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu-in Rehoboam’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rehoboam le Jeroboam kikalah gal kidona om ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Rehoboam lumtonin David khuopi ah a pu a pate tawh kivuiton hi. A nu’ min Naamah ahi a, Ammon-te ahi hi. A tapa Abijam in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Nebat’ tapa Kumpi Jeroboam’ kum sawm le gietna kumin Abijam in Judah gam uh ding kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kum thum sung Jerusalem uh hi. Ama’ nu min Maacah ahi a, Abishalom’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa in ama mai-a a na bawl mawna zosie ama in zong a bawl hi. A pa David’ lungtang puoh bangin Topa a Pasien tungah a lungtang a thuman zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa a Pasien in David ziehin Jerusalem-ah ama meivah khat pie a, ama’ nua-ah tapa khat koi-in Jerusalem a sukip hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Hit mi Uriah tungtang khat ci simlo Topa muna-ah David a dihin gamta a, a hin sung tungtawnin a thupieh khat popo panin ama piel lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hin sung tungtawnin Rehoboam le Jeroboam kikalah gal kidona a om zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abijam gamtatna a omlai teng le a sep zosie, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah? Abijam le Jeroboam kikalah gal kidona a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Abijam lumton a, David khuopi sungah ama kivui hi. Tua ciengin a tapa Asa in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpi Jeroboam’ kum sawmni na kumin Asa in Judah gamah maan ding kipan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama kum sawmli le khat sung Jerusalem ah maang hi. A pi’ min Maacah ahi a, Abishalom’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pupi David gamtat bangin Topa muna-ah Asa a dihin a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in gam sung panin pasal pahtat zosie sumangin a pu a pate bawlsa milim zosie paimang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua nu in Asherah adingin a huothuoi milim khat a bawl ziehin kumpinu hina panin a pi Maacah zong a hemkhie hi; Asa in tua nu’ milim tuntanin Kidron Lui-ah a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin munsangte a kihemkhie sih hi. Hizongle ama a hin sung tungtawnin Topa tungah Asa’ lungtang a thuman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Topa’ inn sungah a pa kiciemna letsongte le ama’ kiciemna letsongte - ngun, kham, le um le beelte a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate khan hun sung tungtawnin Asa le Israel kumpi Baasha kikalah gal kisimna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah sim dingin Israel kumpi Baasha kuonto a, Judah Kumpi Asa kung panin koima a sungtum le a pusuoh a om thei lo nadingin Ramah khuo a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Asa in Topa’ inn sunga goute le kumpipa’ inn sunga kinuasie goute la-in a nasemte khut sungah a pie hi. Kumpi Asa in Damascus-a teng, Aram kumpipa, Hezion’ tapa Tabrimmon, a tapa Ben-hadad kungah tuate puoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka pa le na pa ma bangin keima le nangma kikalah kipawlna khat omsah vai: Nangma kungah ngun le kham letsong kang puoh hi; kei kung panin ama a nuakin thei nadingin pei inlen Israel kumpi Baasha tawh na kipawlna va sutat ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Benhadad in kumpi Asa’ thugen mang a, Israel khuopite sim dingin a galkap uliente sawlin, Ijon, Dan, Abel-bethmaacah, le Chinneroth zosie, Naphtali gam zosie tawh a zo sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Baasha in tua thu a zah ciengin Ramah lam dinkhawl a, Tirzah ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi Asa in Judah gam sung zosie-ah koima a pelem om loin tangtawhna khat a bawl hi: Amate in Baasha in khuo lamna-a a zah Ramah-a sing le suongte a nawn sieng uhi; tuate tawh Kumpi Asa in Benjamin-te’ khuo Giba le Mizpah a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in Asa’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a thahatna zosie, a sep zosie, le a lam khuopite, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah? Ahi vangin ama a vuoi ciengin a kengah natna a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pu a pate tawh Asa lumton a, a pupi David khuopi sungah a pu a pate tawh ama kivui hi; a tapa Jehoshaphat in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah kumpi Asa’ kum nina kumin Jeroboam’ tapa Nadab in Israel tunga maan ding kipan a, Israel ah kum ni sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa’ muna-ah ama siet gamtat a, a pu a pate’ lampi ma zui-in Israel mawna a bawlsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Issachar innkuon Ahijah’ tapa Baasha in ama sawmsim hi; tuale Baasha in Philistia-te’ khuo Gibbethon ah ama a satlia hi; azieh pen Nadab le Israel zosie in Gibbethon khuopi a busim laitah uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judah kumpi Asa’ kum thumna kumin Baasha in Nadab that a, ama in Nadab’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama kumpi ahi zaw behin Jeroboam’ innkuon zosie that hi; Topa in Shilon-te a nasempa Ahijah’ tungtawna a gensa dung zui-in a unpi-in a suhsiet dongin ama in Jeroboam’ innkuon ah mi khat zong hen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua khu ama’ mawna le Israel a mawsahna ahi Jeroboam’ mawnate zieh le Israel Pasien Topa a thangpaisahna zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu-in Nadab’ gamtatna a omlai teng, le a sep zosie, a unpi-in Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A hin sung tungtawnun Asa le Israel kumpi Baasha kikalah gal kidona a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa’ kum thumna kumin Ahijah’ tapa Baasha in Tirzah-a Israel zosie sunga maan ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat a, Jeroboam’ zui lampi le Israel a khielsah ama mawna ma a zui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Baasha langpangin Hanani’ tapa Jehu tungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima in leivui panin nang kang domsang a, ka mi Israel tungah makai-a kang koi hi napi, nang in Jeroboam’ lampi ma zui-in ka mi Israel na mawsah a, a mawna utawh ka thangpai nadingin kei nei kuontaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in Baasha le a innkuon ka phietmang ding a, Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ innkuon bangin nangma’ innkuon ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baasha-a’ ahi khuopi sunga a si popo uite in ne ding hi; tuale ama-a’ ahi gamlaha a si popo vana leng vate in ne ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in Baasha’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a septe, le a thahatna, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Baasha lumton a, Tirzah ah ama kivui hi; tuale a tapa Elah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua tham loin Jeroboam innkuon tawh kibangin Topa muna-ah a sie lama a gamtatna zosie zieh le ama’ khuta a nasepna tawh ama thangpai sahin Jeroboam le a innkuonte a suhsiet ziehin, Hanani’ tapa kamsangpa Jehu tungtawnin Baasha le a innkuonte langkhatah Topa’ thu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Asa’ kum sawmni le guhna kumin Baasha’ tapa Elah in Tirzah ah Israel tunga maan ding kipan a, ama kum ni sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle sakol leeng alang a uhpa a nasem Zimri in ama a sawmsim hi. Tirzah-a kumpi innsung a uhpa Arza’ inn ah zukhamin Tirzah ah ama a op laitah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Asa’ kum sawmni le sagina kumin Zimri pei-in satpuo a, ama thatin ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in uh ding a kipat a kumpi topha tunga a to zaw behin Baasha’ innkuonte a unpi-in that hi; ama in a tanaute pasal khat beh ahi a, a guolte ahi zongin khat zong hingkhawi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamsangpa Jehu tungtawnin Baasha langah Topa’ kammal omsa dung zui-in Zimri in Baasha’ innkuonte zosie tua bangin a susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen Baasha le a tapa Elah’ bawlsa mawnate ziehin Israel khielsahin, a milimte utawh Israel Pasien Topa a lungthahsah zieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu-in Elah’ gamtatna a omlai teng, le a sep zosie, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Asa’ kum sawmni le sagina kumin Zimri in Tirzah ah ni sagi sung uh hi. Tua ciengin Philistia-te-a’ ahi Gibbethon sim dingin galkapte in giephuol a sat vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale giephuol a sat galkapte in, “Zimri in sawmsimin kumpipa that zo hi,” ci thu a za uhi; tua ziehin Israel zosie in khum ni-in giephuol-ah galkapmang Omri Israel kumpi ahisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gibbethon panin Omri le a ompi Israel zosie kuonto-in Tirzah a kui-im uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zimri in tua khuopi a kilah zo lam a mu ciengin kumpi’ inndan kulpi sungah lutin kumpipa’ inn tawh mei-in kihaltha-in a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua banga a kibawlna pen a bawlsa ama’ mawnnate, Topa muna-ah a siet gamtatna, Jeroboam’ pienzie a zuina, a bawlsa a mawna, le Israel in mawna a bawlsahna zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in Zimri’ gamtatna a omlai teng, le a mi sawmdapnate, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel mite pawl ni-in a kikhen uhi; mipi alang in kumpi sem dingin Ginath’ tapa Tibni zui-a, alang in Omri a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle Omri’ nuazuite in Ginath’ tapa Tibni nuazuite a zo zaw uhi; tuale Tibni si-in Omri kumpi a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Asa’ kum sawmthum le khatna kumin Israel-te tunga maan ding kipan hi; ama kum sawm le ni sung maang a, Tirzah ah kum guh sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in Shemer kung panin ngun talent ni tawh Samaria muol a lei hi; ama in kul tawh tua muol im a, tua muol a nei pa Shemar’ min tapin a lamsa khuopi min Samaria phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa muna-ah Omri a sie-in gamta hi; ama mai-a mi zosie sangin a sie zaw-in ama a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ tot lampi zosie, le Israel a khielsah a mawnate, a milimte utawh Israel Pasien, Topa a thangpaisahna uh a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu-in Omri’ nasep a omlai teng, le a thahatna lahna, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Omri lumton hi; tuale Samaria ah ama kivui hi; a tapa Ahab in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Asa’ kum sawmthum le gietna kumin Omri’ tapa Ahab in Israel tungah maan ding kipan a, Samaria ah kum sawmli sung Israel tungah maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Omri’ tapa Ahab in ama’ mai-a mi zosie sangin Topa muna-ah a sie zaw-in a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama adingin Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ mawnate zui ding pen a bai tawh a kibah ma bangin, ama in Sidon-te’ Kumpi Ethbaal’ tanu Jezebel zi-in la a, ama pei-in Baal’ na semin bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in Samaria-a a lam Baal inn sungah Baal adingin maitam khat phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahab in zong khuom siengtho khat bawl a, Ahab in ama’ masanga Israel kumpi zosie sangin Israel Pasien, Topa thangpai nading tam a bawlzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama hun lai-in Bethel-te Hiel in Jericho a sat hi. tuale Topa in Nun’ tapa Joshua tungah a gensa dung zui-in, a tacil Abiram tanlaw liengin ama in khuombul na phut a, a tapa tumpen Segub tanlaw-in a khuo kotpite na phut hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Gilead-a Tishbe khuo panin Tishbe-te Elijah in Ahab kungah, “A mai-a ka dinna Israel Pasien, Topa a hing ahi ma bangin keima thu tawh loin ang tung ding kumte sungah daitui hile, guotui hile a om sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama kungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tam mun panin pei-in nisuona lamah kihei inlen, Jordan’ nisuona lam Cherith Lui-ah kiphuol in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuami lui tui na dawn ding a, khum munah nang ang va dingin va-ahte thu ka pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama pei-in Topa’ thugen bangin gamta hi; ama zong pei-in Jordan nisuona lam Cherith Lui gei-ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingmawngin ama kungah va-ahte in anlum le sa puoh zelin, nitahin zong anlum le moh ma a puoh uhi; tuale ama in lui panin tui a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum gam sungah guo a zuh lo ziehin bakhat zaw ciengin tua lui a kang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tu-in Sidon mite’ khuo Zarephath ah pei inlen khumnah va teng ta’n; azieh pen nang ang va dingin meigong numei khat thu ka pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n dingin Zerephath-ah ama a pei hi. Khuopi tunkot a gei ciengin khumtahah meigong numei khat in sing a na tom hi; ama in tua nu hlanin, “Hai khat tawh ka dawn ding tui ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui pie dinga a kisah laitahin ama in tua nu hlanin, “Anlum halkhat zong na khutah ei tawi ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua nu in, “ Topa na Pasien a hing ahi ma bangin bangma moh emsa ka nei vawt sih hi, beel sungah annel khutdim khat le um sungah sathau halkhat beh ka nei tabo hi; tu-in inn ah pei-in keima le ka tapa adingin tuate bawlin ka neh thei nadingun singkang ni hawkhat a tom dinga ang kuon ka hi a, tuate ka neh zaw cieng gel le a si ding ka hi mai gel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijah in tua nu kungah, “Zau sin; pei inlen na gensa bangin va bawl ta’n; hizongle kei ading moh neuno khat hing bawl masa inlen ka kungah hing tawi in, tua zaw ciengin nangma le na tapa adingin bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Topa in leitungah guo ang zuhsah ni masangin beel sunga annel tawp ngai lo ding a, um sunga sathau zong kiem ngai lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nu pei-in Elijah’ gen bangin a bawl hi. Tuaci’n tua nu, tua pa, le tua nu’ innkuon in ni tampi sung tua an a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elijah tungtawnin Topa’ thugen tawh kizui-in beel sunga annel tawp lo a, um sunga sathau zong kiem lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin inn neinu, tua numei’ tapa a ci na hi; a natna na sie semsem ahi ziehin a huu tawpin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin tua nu in Elijah kungah, “Pasien’ mipa aw, bang dinga nei langpan ahei? Ka mawna ei phawhsah ding le ka tapa sisah dinga ka kunga hing pei na hi hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in tua nu kungah, “Na tapa ei pie in,” a ci hi. Ama in tua nu kang sung panin ama domto a, a giena innkhan tungnungah puoto-in a lupna tungah a siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa tungah ama kiko a, “ Topa ka Pasien aw, a tapa thana tawh ka zin tunna tam meigong nu’ tung nangawnah tuosietna na tunsah amah?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin naupangno tungah ama thumvei kihlung phei-in Topa tungah kiko a, “ Topa ka Pasien aw, tami naupangno hingsahkia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Elijah’ tauna a ngai hi; ama kungah naupangno hinna peikia-in ama a hingkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elijah in tua naupangno la-in, innkhan tungnung panin a inn sungah zawpi a, a nu kungah tut hi; tua ciengin Elijah in, “En in, na tapa hing zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n numei in Elijah kungah, “Tu-in ahile nangma Pasien’ mi na hina le nangma’ kam sunga Topa’ thute a man ahina ka thei ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni tampi zaw, guotui kan kum thum a cin kumin Elijah kungah Topa’ thu tung a, “Pei inlen, Ahab kungah nang mama va kila ta’n; keima in leitungah guo ka zusah ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama ma Ahab kunga kila dingin Elijah a kuon hi. Samaria ah kielpi na sie mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahab in kumpi inn uhpa Obadiah a thuta hi. (Khum hun lai-in Obadiah in nahpitahin Topa a zatah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezebel in Topa’ kamsangte a tha lai-in Obadiah in kamsang zakhat zawpi a, sawm nga ta-in leihawm sung khatah phuolin an le tui tawh a va hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ahab in Obadiah kungah, “Gam sunga ciatui a opna zosie le lui zosie-ah pei in; i sakolte le i laa-sakolte i hinsuo nadingin lopa khat beh i mu thei kha ding a, tua hile ganhing kimkhat i tan sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama ni in zong a sui nading gam a hawm pai gel hi; Ahab mama mun khat lamah pei-in, Obadia mama mun khat lamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lampi-ah Obadiah a pei laitahin Elijah in ama na dawn hi; Obadiah in ama thei pai a, a mai tuolkunin, “Nang ka pu Elijah na hiei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “Ka hi hi. Pei inlen na pu kungah, ‘Elijah tanah om,’ ci-in va gen ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Ahab’ khut sungah na nasempa tha dinga nei pieh nadingin ke’n bangci bangin mawna bawl ka hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa na Pasien a hing ahi ma bangin ka pu in nangma sui dingin a sawl lo minam le kumpi gam khat zong om lo hi; tuale amate in, ‘Tam tahah om lo hi,’ a ci ciengun nangma ang mu lona thu uh ama in kumpigam hile, minam hile a kiciemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in nangma in, “Pei inlen na pu kungah, “Elijah tanah a om hi,’ ci-in va gen ta’n,’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma kung panin ka pei zaw behin Topa’ hlagau in ka thei lona munah nang ang puo ding hi; tuaci’n keima pei-in Ahab kungah va gen ta leng ama in nang ang mu zawh lo ciengin, keima na nasempa in ka khangno lai-a kipanin Topa ka zatah vangin ama in kei ei that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jezebel in Topa’ kamsangte a tha lai-in Topa’ kamsangte mi zakhat, sawmnga ta-in leihawm sungah phuolin, an le tui tawh amate ka vana le ka silbawlte ka pu kungah ang kigen kha nai sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in nangma in, “Pei inlen na pu kungah, ‘Tam sungah Elijah om hi, va ci ta’n,’ nei ci hi,” a ci hi; tua hile ama in keima ei that valon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elijah in, “A mai-a ka dinna Vanglien Topa a hing ahi ma bangin tuni-in ama kungah kei mama ka kilah teitei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ahab tawh kimu dingin Obadiah kuonin ama kungah a gen hi; tuale Elijah tawh kimu dingin Ahab a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahab in Elijah a mu ciengin ama kungah, “Israel a lunggimsah pa nang na hiei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “Keima in Israel ka lungkhamsah sih hi; hinanle nangma in Topa’ thupiehnate na nuasie a, Baal-te nua na zui ziehin nang le na pa’ innkuon in a lungkhamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ziehin tu-in mi sawl inlen, Carmel Muol keima kungah Israel mi zosie, le Jezebel’ sabuoi-a an ne Baal kamsang zali le sawmnga le Asherah kamsang zalite hing khawm in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Israel mi zosie kungah mi sawlin Carmel Muolah kamsangte a kikhawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi zosie lamah Elijah pei a, tuale ama in, “Ngaisutna kibang lo thu ni kikalah bang tanvei kikai-awh ding na hi uh ahei? Topa khu Pasien ahile zui unlen, Baal ahi lezong kizui ta un,” a ci hi. Mite in kamkhat beh a dawng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elijah in mite kungah, “ Topa’ kamsang sung pan kei, kei ngentang ka om tabo a, ahi mawh vangin Baal’ kamsangte zali le sawmnga a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kote kungah bawngtang ni ei pie tuoh un; amate bawngtang khat teelsah unlen, a sa semnenin sing tungah koisahin a tungah meitawsah sih un; keima in bawngtang adang khat go-in sing tungah ka koi ding a, ahi vangin a tungah mei ka taw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin na pasien uh’ tungah thu ngen unlen, keima in zong Topa tungah thu ka ngen ding hi; mei tawh thungetna ei dawng pasien pen Pasien tahtah ahi hi,” a ci hi. Mi zosie in a dawng vua, “Na thugen hoi e!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elijah in Baal’ kamsangte kungah, “Note mi tam na hi ziehun noma dingin bawngtang khat teel unlen bawl masa un; tua ciengin na pasien uh tungah thu ngen un. Hizongle a tungah mei taw sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in amate kipie bawngtang la-in a bawl vua, zingmawnga kipanin sunkim dongin Baal’ tungah thu ngenin, “Baal aw, ei dawng bo ven!” a ci uhi. Hizongle bangma awging om loin koima khat in zong dawng lo hi. A bawlsa uh maitam kimvelah amate a kitom vazawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sunkim ciengin Elijah in amate ehneh ho a, “Kinah ko bo ve un! Ama pasien tahtah ahi a, a thu lungngai pet khat ahiei, ahi sihle a vah dawh khat ahiei, ahi sihle khuolzin khat ahiei, ahi sihle a kimutpet khat ahiei, phawh ding kisam khat ahiei zong hi kha thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate nahpitahin kiko-in a ngaina bangun a pumpi tung vuah si a luon dongin namsaute le siazumte tawh a kisun tepop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sunkim zaw biehpiehna hun cieng dongin a kikoko vangun awging khat zong kiza lo, zong kidawng loin zong kithuh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Elijah in mi zosie kungah, “Ka kungah ei nai ta un,” a ci hi. Tuale mi zosie in ama kung a nai uhi. Ama in a masa-in a kisiesa Topa’ maitam a puophakia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Elijah in, “Na min Israel kici ding hi,” ci-a Topa’ thu tunna Jacob’ tapa minam a phaza zui-in suong sawm le ni a la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tua suong teng tawh Topa’ minin maitam khat a lam hi. Tua ciengin tua maitam kimvelah khaici law ni a ta dingin hawhlam khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A banah ama in a ngaina bangin sing koi a, a bawngtang semnenin tua sing tungah a khangto hi. Ama in, “Beel li sungah tui dim unlen, meihal biehna tung le sing tungah sung un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “A ni veina bawlkia un,” a ci hi. Amate in zong a ni veina a bawlkia uhi. Ama in, “A thum veina bawl un,” a ci a, a thum veina bawl leuleu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n maitam kimvelah tui luongin hawhlam-ah zong tui a vei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kithoina hun ciengin kamsang Elijah a nai-ah pei-in, “Abraham, Isaac, le Israel Pasien, Topa aw, Israel sungah nangma Pasien na hina, nangma’ nasempa ka hina, le tami sil zosie nangma’ thu tawh ka bawl ahina thu tuni-in kitheisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma Pasien na hina le a lungtang uh na heipiehkiana thu tam mite in a thei nadingin ei dawng in, Topa aw, ei dawng in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ meikuong kiesuh a, a meihal biehna, a sing, a suongte, le a leivuite kavamin hawhlam sunga tui nangawn a kanggaw sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi zosie in tuate a mu ciengun tuolah a bawhsuh vua, “ Topa pen Pasien tahtah ahi hi; Topa pen Pasien tahtah ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Elijah in amate kungah, “Baal’ kamsangte man un; khat zong suotasah sih un,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin amate in a man uhi; tuale Elijah in Kishon Lui-ah zawpisuhin tua munah amate that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Elijah in Ahab kungah, “Peito-inlen an ne-in tui dawn in; azieh pen guo zuh ding a huging kiza ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaci’n anne tuidawn dingin Ahab a peito hi. Carmel Muol vumah Elijah kato hi; khum muna lei lahah ama kunin a khupte kikalah a maitang koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in a nasempa kungah, “Tu-in peito-in tuipi lam va en ta’n,” a ci hi. Ama peito-in khuodah a, tuale ama in, “Bangma om sih,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Sagivei peikia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A sagiveina-ah ama in, “En in, tuipi panin mi khat’ khutphang cie sanga a golzaw lo meii themno khat ang kato hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Peito inlen Ahab kungah, ‘Guo in ang khum masangin na sakol leengte guong inlen peisuh tanaw’n,’ va ci ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bano khat sungin meii le hui kithuo-in van ang dup hi; guo tampi zong ang zu hi. A sakol leeng ah Ahab tuongin Jezreel ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hizongle Elijah tungah Topa’ vanglietna tung hi; ama in a kawng gahin Ahab mai Jezreel lutna lamah na tai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahab in Jezebel kungah Elijah’ gamtatna zosie le Baal kamsangte namsau tawh a thagam dan teng gen sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jezebel in Elijah kungah kamtai sawl a, “Zing cieng tu bang hunin amate na tha bangin nangma kang tha sih tah leh pasien-te in kei ei dawm sih heh,” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama a zau hi; ama tho-in a hinna a taipipai hi; Judah-te’ khuo Beer-sheba ah ama a tung hi; khumnah ama in a nasemte a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in gamlahah ni khat lam pei-in luonglau phung nei khatah a to hi. Ama in a si nading thu ngen a, “Pha zo ta, Topa aw, tu-in ka hinna kilah ta’n, azieh pen ka pu ka pate sangin ka hoizaw tuon sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin luonglau phung nei khatah lumin a kimu hi. Thakhatthu-in vantungmi khat in ama khoi-in ama kungah, “Tho inlen an ne in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama a khuodah leh a lutang gei-a suong sa tungah a ki-em moh khat le tui hai khat a om hi. Ama in ne-in dawnin a lumkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi a ni veina peikia-in ama khoi a, “Tho inlen an nekia in, tua hi sihle na khuolzin nading gamla mama lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama zong tho-in anne tuidawnin om a, an a neh huvangin ni sawmli le zan sawmli sung lam pei zo a, Pasien’ muol Horeb a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua muna leihawm khatah lutin a zangie hi. Tua ciengin ama tungah Topa’ thu tung a, “Elijah, nang tana bang bawl na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “Vanglien Pasien, Topa adingin ka pawnthaw mama hi; azieh pen Israel-te in na thuciemna nuasie-in na maitamte a paimang vua, namsau tawh na kamsangte a that sieng uhi. Kei ngentang ka om ta bo a, keima zong tha dingin ei sui lai vaset uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Pusuoh inlen, muolvum Topa mai-ah ding in,” a ci hi, azieh pen Topa in ang nawh ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua laitahin huipi nahpitahin langin muolte a sem tepal a, Topa mai-a suongtumte zong a satkeh sieng hi; ahi vangin tua hui sungah Topa om lo hi; tua hui a kap zaw ciengin zil ling a, ahi vangin zilling lahah Topa om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zil a kilin zaw ciengin meikuong om a, ahi vangin meikuong sungah zong Topa om kan lo hi. Meikuong a mi zaw ciengin awnem hiuhiau khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua awging Elijah in a zah ciengin a puontuol tawh a mai khu-in pusuoh a, leihawm lutna-ah a ding hi. Ama kungah aw khat gingin, “Elijah, tam sunga bang bawl na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Vanglien Pasien Topa adingin ka pawnthaw mama hi; azieh pen Israel-te in na thuciemna nuasie-in na maitamte a paimang vua, namsau tawh na kamsangte a that uhi. Kei ngentang ka om tabo a, kei nangawn zong tha dingin ei sui lai vaset uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ama kungah, “Pei inlen, Damascus senel gam zuonin kilekia ta’n. Na tun ciengin Aram tunga kumpi dingin Hazael sathau na nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang in Israel tunga kumpi dingin Nimshi’ tapa Jehu sathau na nu ding a, nang tanga kamsang dingin Abel-meholah khuomi Shaphat’ tapa Elisha sathau na nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hazael in a na tha khah lo poma Jehu in that ding hi; tuale Jehu in a na thakhah lo poma Elisha in that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle Israel sungah Baal mai-a a lu kun lo, ama a nam kha lo mihing tul sagi ka hen lai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum mun panin ama pei a, Shaphat’ tapa Elisha in bawng kap khat tawh lo a kai laitah a mu hi. A masangah bawngtang kap sawm le kap ni om a, a nukhia pen bawngkap tawh lo kai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a bawngtangte nuasie-in Elijah nuadel a, “Ka nu ka pa tawh ei kivaihlahsah phot inlen, tua ciengin na nua kang zui ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Elijah in ama kungah, “Kilekia ta’n, ke’n nang bang kang ci son ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama a zuina panin Elisha kilekia-in bawngtang kap khat manin go a, bawng hahkolte singin zangin a sa huon a, mi hawmpiehin a ne uhi. Tua ciengin ama dingin Elijah’ nua zui a, tuaci’n ama’ nasem a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aram Kumpipa Ben-hadad in a galkapte khawm hi; ama a panpi kumpi sawmthum le ni, le sakolte le leengte a om hi. Samaria sim dingin ama kuonto a, tua khuopi kuikhumin a bulu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in khuopi sunga om Israel Kumpipa Ahab kungah kamtaite sawlin ama kungah a gen hi: “Tam bangin Ben-hadad in a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngun le na kham teng keima-a’ ahi hi; na zi hoi pente le na tate zong keima-a’ ma ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in dawng a, “Ka pu, kumpipa aw, na gen bangin keima le ka neisa zosie a unpi-in nangma-a’ ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamtaite kilekia-in, “Ben-hadad in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Na kungah mi kang sawl a, “Keima kungah na ngun, na kham, le na zi na tate hing puoh in,’ ei cisah hi,” a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hizongle zing cieng tu bang hunin na kungah ka nasemte kang sawl ding a, amate in nangma’ innsung le na nasemte’ innsung hing longin amau’ dei popo tungah khut nga-in a la ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in gamsung upa zosie hlan a, “Tu-in en un! Tam mipa in bangza tahin buoi nading sui ahei ci thei un; azieh pen ama in ka zite, ka tate, ka ngun le ka kham teng a la dingin mi ang sawl hi; keima in ama’ thu ka niel sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin upa zosie le mi zosie in ama kungah, “A thu ngai sinlen, zong thukim sin,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Ben-hadad’ kamtaite kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa kungah tam bangin gen un: Na nasempa kunga nei kalh masah zosie ka bawl ding hi; ahi vangin tami thu ka bawl thei sih hi,” a ci hi. Kamtaite pei-in ama kungah thu a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ben-hadad in ama kungah mi sawl a, “Samaria leivui khu ka nua ei zui zosie’ khutkuoh a dim tah ma leh, pasien-te in kei ei dawm sih hinlen, tam sanga a nasie zaw-in ei bawl taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in dawng a, “Ama kungah na gen un: Gal a zaw cienga galvan a suodawh pa a kiphatsah bangin galvan tawh a kivon pa kiphasah sih heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in ama in buhte sungah kumpite tawh zu a dawn laitahun, Ben-hadad in tam thu a zah ciengin ama in a mite kungah, “Panmun la un!” a ci hi. Tuale khuopi sim dingin panmun a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpi Ahab kungah kamsang khat peito a, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi. Tam mihon tampi zosie na mu ei mah? En in, tuni-in na khut sungah amate kang pie ding hi; tuale keima Topa ka hi lam na thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahab in, “A koi pen tawh nei pieh ding ahei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi. Gamkaih uhpa’ nasemte tawh, ci hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Koi in galsim a pan masa diei?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Nangma hi vecin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in gamkaih uhpa’ nasem zani le sawmthum le ni a khawm hi; tua zaw ciengin Israel mi zosie, tul sagi a khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ben-hadad in a kipawlpi kumpi sawmthum le nite tawh buh sungah zu dawnin zukhamin a op laitah uh sunkim hunin amate a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gamkaih a uh khangnote a kuon masa uhi. Ben-hadad in thukante sawl a, amate in ama kungah, “Samaria panin mi ang kuon uhi,” ci-in thu a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Kilemna bawl dinga hing kuon ahi uleh na hingmat un; galsim dinga ang kuon ahi uleh zong a hing ma-in na man un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuopi panin gamkaih uhpa’ nasemte le amate a zui galkapte a kuonkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi khat in a kisihpi ciet uh a that vua, Aram-te taimangin Israel in amate a nuadel a, hinanle Syria kumpipa Ben-hadad pen sakol tung tuongte tawh sakol khatah tuongin a taimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel kumpipa peikhia-in sakolte le sakol leengte busim a, Aram-te zo-in tampitah that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa kungah kamsangpa pei-in ama in, “Hing pei in, kithakhausah inlen, bang bawl ding ci limtahin ngaisun in; azieh pen khuokhal ciengin nang ang do dingin Aram kumpipa ang kuonto kia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aram kumpipa’ nasemte in ama kungah, “Amau’ pasien pen ahile muoltung pasien-te ahi a, tuaci’n eite sangin amate a hatzaw uhi; ahi vangin amate tawh zanglei-ah kido leih amate sangin i hat zaw valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam bangin zong bawl in: Kumpite amau’ panmun ciet panin khawlsah inlen, amau’ munah galkapmangte koi in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuale na taansa galkapte tawh a kikim galkapte, sakol tangin sakol, leeng tangin leeng khawm in; tua ciengin zanglei-ah amate tawh i kido ding vua, amate sangin i hatzaw tahtah ding uhi,” a ci uhi. Ama in a thu uh mangin a gen bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuokhal hun sungin Ben-hadad in Aram-te khawm a, Israel do dingin Aphek ah a kuonto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel-te a kikhawm vua, lam-an a kiguon zaw ciengin amate do dingin a kuon uhi; Israel mite in a mai vuah keelta hon ni a kizawt bangin Aram-te tawh kimaingatin giephuol a sat vua, Aram-te ahile gam sung a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien’ mipa khat in nai-in Israel kumpipa kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Aram-te in, ‘ Topa pen muoltung pasien ahi a, zanglei pasien hi lo hi,’ a ci ziehun nangma’ khut sungah tami a lien mi honpite zosie kang pie ding a, keima Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in zong ni sagi sung kimaingatin giephuol a sat uhi. A ni sagi ni-in galdo a kipan uhi; ni khat sungin Israel-te in Aram-te’ lei galkapte tul zakhat that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A omlai teng Aphek khuopi sungah a taimang uhi; tuale a kinuasie mihing tul sawmni le tul sagi zong kulpi cim in a vuanel hi. Ben-hadad zong taimang a, a kiphuol dingin khuopi sungah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nasemte in ama kungah, “En in, Israel innkuon’ kumpite pen hepina a nei kumpite ahi uhi, ci-in ka za uhi; ka kawng vuah la-ip puon tengin ka lu tung vuah khauhuol vielin Israel kumpipa kungah ei hawsah in; ama in nang ang hinkhawi mel zong kithei lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n a kawng vuah la-ip puon tengin a lu vuah zong khauhuol vielin Israel kumpipa kungah a haw vua, “Na nasempa Ben-hadad in, ‘Hepina tawh ei hingkhawi teitei bo heh,’ ci hi,” a ci uhi. Ama in, “Ama a hing lai ahi amah?” a ci hi. Ama ka sanggampa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu-in mite in a thugen thakhatin man thei-in a zop pai vua, “Hi hi, na nasempa Ben-hadad hing lai hi,” a ci uhi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Pei unlen ama ka kungah hing peipi un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama kungah Ben-hadad a pei hi; tuale ama in a sakol leeng tungah ama tuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ben-hadad in ama kungah, “Ka pa in na pa-a’ a na lahpieh khuopite kang piekia ding hi; tuale ka pa in Samaria sungah a bawl ma bangin nang in Damascus ah nangma adingin sumbuh na bawl thei ding hi,” a ci hi. Israel kumpipa in thuhkia a, ”Tua na gen thute banga na sep leh nang kang hla ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in khum mipa tawh thukimna khat bawlin a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehna tawh kamsang honte lahah khat in adang khat kungah, “Keima ei sat in!” a ci hi. Ahi vangin tua mipa in ama sat nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ama kungah, “ Topa’ thu mang lo na hi ziehin ka kung pan a na pei zaw behin humpi khat in nang ang that ding hi,” a ci hi. Ama kung pan a pei zaw ciengin humpi khat tawh ama kituoh a, ama a petlia pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in midang khat mukia a, “Keima ei sat in!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tua mipa in zong ama tehpuong pai-in a liemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsangpa peikhie-in lampi-ah kumpipa ngah a, puon tawh a mit khu-in a mel a sel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama a nawh laitahin kumpipa kungah kiko a, “Gal sungah na nasempa ka va kuon ta hi; tua ciengin galkap khat in ka kungah mi khat ang zawpi a, ‘Tam mipa na cing in. Ama na taisuo leh ama tangin nangma hing kithat ding a, ahi sihle ngun talent khat na lieu ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Muncin tengah na nasempa ka kitahla kalin ama na taimang hi,” a ci hi. Israel kumpipa in, “Nangma’ thukhenna bang hi taheh; Nang mama in thu na kikhen ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a mit tuom a hawh leh Israel kumpipa in ama pen kamsangte khat ahi lamtah a thei pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsangpa in ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Tha dinga ka bawl mipa na pitsuo ziehin ama’ hinna tangin nangma’ hinna, ama’ mite tangin nangma’ mite kila ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel kumpipa lungkimlo le maikhingin inn lam zuonin Samaria a tung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A sawt loin tam bang thu teng a pieng hi: Jezreel-te Naboth in Samaria kumpi Ahab’ kumpi inn gei-ah lengga lei khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahab in Naboth kungah, “Na lengga lei kei inn tawh kinai ahi ziehin ante cinna huon dingin ei pie ta’n; keima in a tangin tua sanga a hoizaw lengga lei khat kang pie ding hi; tua ahi sih a, nang dinga a hoi zawh leh a man ding sum kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle Naboth in, “Ka pu ka pate’ gamh nang kang pieh ding pen Topa in phal vawt lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezreel-te Naboth in ama kungah thu a gen ziehin Ahab lungkimlo le maikhingsa-in inn lam a zuon hi; azieh pen ama in, “Ka pu ka pate’ gamh nang kang pie sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Ama a lupna tung sena-in kinei a, a mai hei-in an ne loin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama kungah a zi Jezebel pei a, “An neh lona za ding dongin bang dinga hici lunggim na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “Bangzieh ahei cile Jezreel-te Naboth kungah, ‘Na lengga lei sum tawh ei leisah in; tua ahi sih a, na dei zawh leh lengga lei adang khat nang pie vang,’ ka ci hi; ahi vangin ama in ei dawngin, ‘Ka lengga lei kang pie sih ding hi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A zi Jezebel in ama kungah, “Tulaitah Israel a uhpa hi lo na mah? Tho-in an ne inlen kilung nuomsah in; keima in Jezreel-te Naboth’ lengga lei kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Ahab’ min tawh laihlahte giel a, tuate tungah Ahab’ seal kitum hi; ama’ khuopi sunga Naboth tawh a teng upate le milien teng tungah a lai hlah ding teng a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua nu in a laihlahte sungah, “An tan ding khat tangtawh unlen, mihonpite lahah Naboth mun thupi-ah tosah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama tawh kimaingatin mi ginalo ni koi-in ama langpangin a mawna suisah unlen, ‘Nang in Pasien le kumpipa na samsie hi,’ cisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama’ khuomi, khuopi sunga teng upate le mi thupi a zatahhuoi teng in Jezebel’ gen bangin amate tungah a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in zong an tan nading thu khat a tangtawh vua, mipite lah mun thupi-ah Naboth a tosah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ginalo ni pei-in ama tawh kigalsai-in a to uhi; tuale mipite mai-ah mi ginalote in ama’ mawna a sui vua, “Naboth in Pasien le kumpipa samsie hi,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n amate in khuopi pulamah ama kaiphitin suong tawh a seplia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jezebel kungah amate in thu tutin, “Naboth suong tawh kiseplia zo hi; ama si zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naboth suong tawh kisepin a si zo lam Jezebel in a zah zaw behin Jezebel in Ahab kungah, “Pei inlen, sum tawh lei dinga na kut ama in a phal lo, Jezreel-te Naboth’ lengga lei la-in tang in; azieh pen Naboth hing nawn loin si zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naboth a sina thu Ahab in a zah behin Jezreel-te Naboth’ lengga lei-ah Ahab kuonsuhin a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tishbe-te Elijah kungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Samaria gam a uh Israel Kumpi Ahab tawh kimu dingin va kuonsuh in; Naboth’ lengga lei a lahpieh dingin khumnah ama a op laitah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Ama thatin na lahpieh ta amah? ci-hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi. Nangma in ama kungah, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: ‘Uite in Naboth’ sisan a liena munah nangma’ sisan zong ui in lieh ding hi, ci hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahab in Elijah kungah, “Ka galpa aw, kei nei mu zo ta amah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “ Topa’ muna-ah nang le nang a sie bawl dingin kipumpieh na hi ziehin nang kang mu ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in nang tungah gimna kang tungsah ding hi; nang hing paimangin Israel gam sungah Ahab’ mi kici poma sal hile, a suohta hile ka sumaimang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nang in kei nei lungthahsah zieh le Israel in mawna na bawlsah ziehin na innkuon zong Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ innkuon le Ahijah’ tapa Baasha’ innkuon tawh kang kibangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jezebel’ tungtang thu zong Topa in gen a, ‘Uite in Jezebel’ kulpi gei-ah Jezebel a ne ding uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahab tawh kisai khuopi sunga a si mi khat popo ui in ne ding hi. Tuale gamlahah a si mi khat popo vana leng vate in ne ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(A tahtahin a zi Jezebel’ hantawhna ziehin Topa muna-ah Ahab bangin a sie bawl dinga a kipumpieh koima dang om nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Israel-te mai-ah a delmang Amor-te gamtat bangin milimte bie-in kidahhuoi-in a gamta hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahab in tua thu teng a zah ciengin ama in a puonte botkeh a, a pum tungah la-ip puon silin an tangin la-ip puon tungah lum hi; ama cimaw lungkia-in a vaiva hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tishbe-te Elijah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka mai-ah Ahab a kiniemkhieh dan na mu ei mah? Keima mai-ah amama tua bangin kiniemkhieh ahi ziehin a hin sungin ama tungah gimna ka tungsah sih ding hi; hizongle a tapa’ hun sungin a innkuonte tungah gimna ka tungsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aram le Israel-te kum thum sung gal kido loin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin kum thum a cin kumin Israel kumpipa kungah Judah kumpi Jehoshaphat hawsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in a nasemte kungah, “Ramoth-gilead khu ei-a’ ahi a, hizongle Aram kumpipa’ khut sung panin lahkia ding bangma i sawm lo lam na thei vuoi mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ramoth-gilead ah gal do dingin i kuonton diei mah?” a ci hi. Jehoshaphat in Israel kumpipa dawng a, “Kei le nang a kibang i hi hi; ka mite nangma’ mi ahi a, ka sakolte nangma’ sakol ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle Jehoshaphat in Israel kumpipa kungah, “ Topa thu dong masa phot in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in kamsang zali bang khawmin amate kungah, “Ramoth-gilead sim dingin ka kuon diei, ahi sihle ka khawl zaw diei?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Kuonto in; azieh pen Topa in kumpipa’ khut sungah ang pie ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle Jehoshaphat in, “Tam sungah thu i dawh thei ding Topa’ kamsang adang koima khat beh om lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Jehoshaphat kungah, “ Topa thu i dawh thei nading, Imlah’ tapa Micaiah a kici mi khat omlai hi; hizongle ama in ka thu a hoi lamin ei gen ngai sih a, gimna ding vive a gen den ziehin ama ka muda hi,” a ci hi. Jehoshaphat in, “Kumpipa in tua bangin thugen sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in ulien khat hlanin, “Imlah’ tapa Micaiah mallangin va hlan ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua laitahin Samaria tunkot lutna ancilna phuola kumpi topha tungah Israel kumpipa le Judah Kumpipa Jehoshaphat to-in a kumpi puon utawh kizemin a om uhi; tuale kamsang zosie in ama gel mai-ah kam a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chenaanah’ tapa Zedekiah in ama adingin sia sakite bawlin, “ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: amate pen tamte tawh amanthai dongin na sun ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamsang zosie in tua bang ma-in kam a sang vua, “Ramoth-gilead ah kuonto inlen guolzo in; Topa in kumpipa’ khut sungah ang pie ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Micaiah hlan dinga a kuon kamtaipa in ama kungah, “En in, kithukhatin kamsang teng’ thugen pen kumpipa adingin a hoi lam vive ahi hi. Nang in zong amate bangin a hoi lamin genpieh ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongnanle Micaiah in, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin, Topa in ka kunga ang gen popo ka gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa kung a tun ciengin kumpipa in ama kungah, “Micaiah, Ramoth-gilead ah galsim dingin i kuon diei, ahi sihle i khawl tadi diei ?” a ci hi. Ama in zong dawng a, “Kuonto inlen va guolzo ta’n; Topa in kumpipa’ khut sungah ang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle kumpipa in ama kungah, “ Topa’ minin keima kungah thu dang kici bangma gen loin thuman beh nang gen nadingin bangza vei hing kiciemsah ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Micaiah in, “Israel zosie tuucing a nei lo tuute bangin muoltung tengah a kithethang ka mu hi. Topa in, ‘Tam mite in pu a nei sih uhi; lungnuom tahin a inn ciet vuah pei uheh,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ama in kei tungtang thu a hoi lamin khat mama zong ang gen sih ding a, gimna ding beh ang gen ding hi, ci thu na kungah kang gen tamal sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Micaiah in, “Tua ahi ziehin Topa’ thugen ngai in: Keima in a kumpi topha tungah Topa to-in, a ziet a vei-a a ding vantung mihonpi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in, “Ramoth-gilead ah ama kato-in a si thei nadingin koi pen in Ahab va zawl ta ding ahei?’ a ci hi. Tua ciengin khat in thu khat genin adang khat in thudang khat gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale Topa mai-ah hlagau khat pei-in ding a, ‘Keima’n va zawl ta vang,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, ‘Bang na ci zawl diei?’ ci-in ama dong hi. Ama in dawng a, “Keima pei-in a kamsangte zosie’ kam sungah zuouthei hlagau khat ka va hi ta ding hi,’ a ci hi. Tua ciengin Topa in, ‘Ama a va zawl ding na hi a, nangma in na zo ding hi; pei inlen va tuaci bawl ta’n,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n nangma in en in, Topa in tami na kamsangte zosie’ kam sungah zuouthei hlagau khat koi zo ta hi; Topa in nangma dingin gimna na tuo ding a khensatsa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Chenaanah’ tapa Zede-kiah in Micaiah zuonto-in phebeh a, “ Topa’ hlagau in nangma kunga thu ang gen dingin bang lampi tawh kei ei kalsan thei ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Micaiah in dawngkia-in, “A kiphuol dingin innkhan sungtawngah na pei ni ciengin thei na vecin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel kumpipa in, “Micaiah man unlen khuopi uhpa Amon le kumpipa’ tapa Joash kungah puohkia ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Kumpipa in tam bangin gen hi: Thongah tam mipa khum unlen, lungnuom taha kang tunkia masangin an le tui na gieutausah un,” ci hi,’ va ci ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Micaiah in, “Lungnuoma nang kilekia poma leh Topa in kei tungtawnin thu a gen lo hi taven,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “No teng zosie in na unpi-un za un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ramoth-gilead ah Israel kumpipa le Judah kumpi Jehoshaphat a kuonto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Kei le kei mel kiselin gal sungah va kuon ta vang. Ahi vangin nang in na kumpi puonte sil in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Israel kumpipa in a mel selin gal sungah a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu-in Aram kumpipa in a leeng makai mi sawmthum le nite thupie a, “Milien hile, mineu hile koima tawh kido sih unlen, Israel kumpipa beh tawh kido un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leeng makaite in Jehoshaphat a mu ciengun amate in, “Khum pa Israel kumpipa hi ngelngel ei,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n ama tawh kido dingin a kihei pai uhi; tuale Jehoshaphat a kikozah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leeng makaite in tuapa Israel kumpipa ahi lo lamtah a thei ciengun ama a nuadel na panun a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in a thal kuoi-in a mawh kap a, tuale thei khah lopi-in Israel kumpipa’ galhiem awmdal kikalah lutin ama a kha hi; tuaci’n ama in leenghawl pa kungah, “Kei liem zo ta ka hi ziehin kilekia inlen, gal sung panin ei puomang ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum ni-in gal kidona nasie mama a, kumpipa in Aram-te maingatin nitah a si dongin a leeng tungah a kingam hi; a liemma panin leeng dop lamah a sisan a luongsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nitum kuon ciengin galkapte lahah tangtawhna khat om a, “Koipo ama’ khuopi ciet-ah, a koimapo ama gam ciet ah!” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa si a, Samaria ah kipeipi hi; amate in Samaria ah kumpipa a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Samaria buol gei-ah a leeng a sawp vua, Topa gensa kammal dung zui-in uite in a sisan liehtumin tua sungah numei pahtatte a kisil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tu-in Ahab’ gamtatna a omlai teng, a septe zosie, a saiha inn lamte, le ama’ na sat khuopi zosie, Israel Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu a pate tawh Ahab lumton hi; tuale a tapa Ahaziah in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel Kumpi Ahab a kum lina kumin Asa’ tapa Jehoshaphat in Judah uh ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Gam uh ding a kipatin Jehoshaphat kum sawmthum le nga pha a, kum sawmni le nga sung Jerusalem uh hi. A nu’ min pen Azubah ahi a, Shilhi’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in a pa Asa’ lampi zosie zui hi; tua lampi panin ama piel loin, Topa muna-ah a manin gamta hi; hinanle munsangte a kilamang sih a, munsangte tungah mite in siemthoi-in gimnamtuite a hal lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in Israel kumpipa tawh zong kilemna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tu-in Jehoshaphat’ gamtatna a omlai teng, ama in a lah a thahatna, le a galdo dan, Judah Kumpite’ Khang Sutna Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ama in a pa Asa’ hun lai-in gam sunga pasal pahtat omlai teng a that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Edom ah kumpi om a, a khut nei-a pa khat in kumpi sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in Ophir kham sui-in a pei nadingin Tarshish tembawte a bawl hi; ahi vangin Ezion-geber ah tembawte a kisiet ziehin amate a pei thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ahab’ tapa Ahaziah in Jehoshaphat kungah, “Tembawte tungah keima’ nasemte le nangma’ nasemte peitonsah in,” a ci hi, hinanle Jehoshaphat a nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A pu a pate tawh Jehoshaphat lumton hi; a tapa Jehoram in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Judah kumpi Jehoshaphat a maan kum sawm le sagina kumin Ahab’ tapa Ahaziah in Samaria panin Israel tungah maan ding kipan a, kum ni sung Israel tungah a maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama siet gamtat a, a nu le a pa’ lampi le Israel a mawsah Nebat’ tapa Jeroboam’ lampi a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ama in Baal’ na semin a bie hi; ama in a pa gamtat ma bangin Israel Pasien, Topa a lungthahsah hi.
  </para>
</usx>
